<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">Job</book>
  <para style="h">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">Job</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="mt">Job</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uz ram dawk tami buet touh ao teh, a min teh Job doeh. Ahni teh toun hane awm hoeh, tamikalan, Cathut ka taket e, kahawihoehe lamthung ka roun e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Capa 7 touh hoi canu 3 touh a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tawn e naw teh, tu 7,000, kalauk 3,000, maitotan 500, lamanu 500, hoi a sannaw moikapap a tawn. Ahni teh Kanîtholae taminaw pueng hlak tami ka lentoe poung e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A capanaw ni kum tangkuem amamae a khenae pawi a sak awh navah, amamae im dawk bu canae pawi a sak awh teh a kamkhueng awh navah, a tawncanunaw ka 3, touh hai canei hanelah ouk a coun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hottelah bu canae pawi abaw hnukkhu vah, Job ni a kaw awh teh, ouk a kamkhueng sak awh. Amom a thaw teh ahnimae milu kuep lah hmaisawi thuengnae sathei ouk a poe. Bangkongtetpawiteh Job ni ka capanaw ni yonnae sak awh vaiteh, a lungthin hoi Cathut hah pahnawt awh langvaih telah ati. Hottelah, Job ni pou a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cathut e capanaw BAWIPA e hmalah tâconae hnin a pha torei teh, Setan hai ahnimouh koe a tho van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Setan koe nâ lahoi maw na tho atipouh. Setan ni BAWIPA talai van ka kâhei teh ka kumluennae koehoi, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Setan koe ka san Job he na pouk boimaw. Talai van dawk ahni patetlae toun han kaawm hoeh e, tamikalan Cathut ka taket e hoi, kahawihoehe lamthung ka roun e awm hoeh, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Setan ni BAWIPA a pathungnae teh, Job ni Cathut hah a khuekhaw awm laipalah maw a taki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahni teh a imthung hoi, a tawn e naw pueng hoi, a tengpam pueng pet na kalup teh, a kut hoi a tawk e naw pueng hah yawhawi na poe teh, na kamphung sak nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atuvah na kut pho nateh a tawn e hnonaw pueng hah tek pouh haw, na hmaitung roeroe vah nama tang na pahnawt han doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BAWIPA ni, Setan koe, khenhaw! a tawn e naw pueng teh, nange na kut dawk ao. Ama teh tek hanh atipouh. Hahoi Setan teh BAWIPA koehoi a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnin touh hnin teh, a canu hoi a capanaw teh, a hmau kacue im dawkvah a ca awh teh misurtui a nei awh lahun nah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job koe patoune buet touh a yawng teh, maitotannaw talai a kanawk awh lahun nah, lanaw hai ateng a pâ awh lahun navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sheba taminaw ni na tuk awh teh, koung a la awh toe na sannaw hah tahloi hoi a thei awh teh, kai buet touh dueng doeh, nang koe dei hanelah ka hlout atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A dei lahun nah tami alouke bout a tho. Kalvan hoi Cathut e hmai a bo teh, tu hoi na sannaw hah koung a kak teh be a kahma toe. Kai buet touh dueng doeh nang koe dei hanelah ka hlout e lah ka o atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A dei lahun nah tami alouke bout a tho. Khaldean taminaw ahu kathum touh lah ao awh teh, kalauknaw hah koung na lawp awh, na sannaw hai tahloi hoi be a thei awh. Kai buet touh dueng doeh nang koe dei hanelah ka hlout atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dei lahun nah tami alouke bout a tho. Na canu hoi na capanaw ni, a hmau kacuepoung e im vah a ca awh teh misurtui a nei awh lahun navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khenhaw! kahrawng lahoi kahlî katang poung e a tho teh, imnaw hah a hmang teh, thoundoun, tanglanaw hah koung a ratet teh koung a due. Kai buet touh dueng doeh nang koe dei hanelah ka hlout atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi Job ni a thaw teh, ahni a ravei, a lû luengpalueng lah a ngaw teh, talai dawk a tabo teh a bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anu e von thung hoi tak caici lah ka tâco teh, tak caici lah bout ka ban han. BAWIPA ni na poe teh BAWIPA ni bout a la. BAWIPA min teh pholennae awm seh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hetnaw dawkvah Job ni yonnae sak laipalah Cathut yonpennae tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cathut e capanaw BAWIPA e hmalah a tâconae hnin bout a pha toteh, Setan hai BAWIPA e hmalah kamnue van hanlah ahnimouh koe a tho van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Setan teh nâ lahoi maw na tho atipouh. Setan ni BAWIPA a pathungnae teh, talai van ka kâhei teh, ka kumluennae koehoi, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Setan koevah, ka san Job heh na pouk boimaw. Ahni patetlae toun han kaawm hoeh e, tamikalan, Cathut ka taket e hoi, kahawihoehe lamthung ka roun e, apihai awm hoeh. Bang hoeh e dawk na ka raphoe nakunghai ama min la doeh poe awm ti atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Setan ni BAWIPA hah a pathung teh, vuen hanlah vuen lah doeh ao, tami ni a tawnta e pueng hah a hring nahanelah a kâpasoung yawkaw han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hateiteh, atu na kut pho nateh, a hru hoi atak tek pouh haw, na hmaitung vah na pahnawt han doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Setan koe, khenhaw! ahni teh na kut dawk ao. Hateiteh a hringnae hah pâhlung atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Setan teh BAWIPA e hmaitung hoi a tâco teh, Job hah a khok koehoi a lû totouh, ka patawpoung e moihna hoi a kawi sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kâkoe nahanelah Job ni ampaikei hah a la teh hraba dawk a tahung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A yu ni, na lannae hah pou na kuet han rah maw. Na Cathut hah thoebo nateh, dout lawih atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hateiteh ahni ni napui koe, ka pathu e napui ni lawk a dei e patetlah na dei. Bangtelamaw Cathut koehoi hawinae ka hmu katang teh, thoenae hai hmawt mahoeh maw, telah atipouh. Hete hno pueng dawk Job ni apâhni dawk hoi yonnae dei hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Job e a hui kathum touh ni, het patet e hawihoehnae ni a pha sin e a thai awh torei teh, amamouh aonae koehoi lengkaleng a tho awh. Teman tami Eliphaz Shuhi tami Bildad hoi, Naamath tami Zophar, bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni lungpahawi hane, lungmawng sak hanelah a kamkhueng awh teh a kâpan awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni ahlanae koehoi Job hah a khet awh navah, nout thai awh hoeh. Kacaipounglah a ka awh teh, khohnanaw hah vekvek a ravei awh teh, a lûnaw dawk vaiphu a kâphuen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hottelah hnin sari touh hoi rum sari touh thung talai dawk a tahungkhai awh teh, apinihai ahni koe lawk kam touh hai dei awh hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a lungmathoe poung tie hah a panue awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Job ni a pahni dawk hoi a khenae hnin hah thoe a bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Job ni ati e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka khenae hnin hah kahmat pawiteh, capa a vawn ati e tangmin hai kahmat pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatnae hnin hah hmonae lah awm pawiteh, Cathut ni lathueng lahoi khen hanh naseh. Hoehpawiteh, angnae ang hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmonae hoi duenae tâhlip ni ramuk naseh, tâmai ni ramuk e, kanîthun e hmonae ni pakhi naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatnae tangmin hah hmonae ni kuen naseh, hatnae kum dawk e hninnaw dawkvah lunghawi van hanh naseh. Thapa touknae dawk hai bawk hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Oe, hatnae tangmin hah kingkadi e tangmin lah awm pawiteh, lunghawinae kamthang pai hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuitam thaw sak hane coungkacoe kaawmnaw ni, hatnae hnin hah, thoekâbonaw ni thoebo awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatnae tangmin amom lae âsi hah mawm naseh, angnae hah tawng awh naseh. Hateiteh, hmawt awh hanh naseh. Kanî a tâco e hai, hmawt hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, anu e thun hah khan hoeh eiteh, ka mithmu vah, ka lungmathoenae hah kâhrawk hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangkongmaw ka tâco tahma vah, ka due hoeh va. Bangkongmaw von dawk hoi ka tâco nah, kahmakata hoeh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongmaw phai dawk tawm e lah ka o, bangkongmaw ka nei hane sanutui na pânei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka i vaiteh, karoumcalah ka o han ei, mat ka i vaiteh, ka kâhat hane boum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Talai siangpahrang hoi khokhangkungnaw, ka rawk e bout ka kangdout sakkungnaw hoi vah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hoehpawiteh, sui ka tawn e tami ka lentoe e, a im dawk ngun hoi kakawi sak naw hoi vah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hoehpawiteh, thakoup hoehnahlan ka khe e camo, angnae kahmawt boihoeh e, camo patetlah, kapawk e lah ka o hoeh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hawvah tamikathoutnaw ni, runae a sak e hah a kâhat awh teh, hawvah thakatawnnaw hah a kâhat awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hawvah thongkabawt e cungtalah a kâhat awh teh, repcoungroe pawlawk hai thai hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hawvah tami kathoung kalen naw cungtalah ao awh teh, a sannaw hah a bawi koehoi a hlout.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangkongmaw runae ka khang e koevah, angnae poe e lah ao teh, bangdawkmaw a lung ka mathout e koe hringnae hah poe e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Due han a ngai poung, hateiteh, tho hoeh. Pakawp e râw hlak vah, hoe ka pataw e ka tawng e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />phuen a hmu awh navah, dei thai hoeh e a lung kahawi katang e koevah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />bangdawkmaw a lamthung hro lah kaawm e koevah, angnae hah poe e lah ao. Cathut ni rapan hoi kalupsin e koevah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, rawca yueng lah ka cingou teh ka khuikanae mitphi hai tui ka lawng e palang patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka takipoung e hah, ka tak dawk a pha teh, ka ngaihri poung e ni na thosin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka phunep hoeh dawk duem kaawm thai hoeh. Kâhat panuek hoeh, bangkongtetpawiteh, rucatnae ni a pha telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Teman tami Eliphaz ni ahni koe bout a dei e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nang koe lawk kam touh ka dei haw vai, na thaima han vaimoe. Hatei apinimaw dei laipalah ao thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami moikapap na cangkhai toe. Kut tha kaawm hoeh e tha na o sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lawk ni karawmnaw hah a thaw sak teh, khokpakhu tha kaawm hoeh e tha ao sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hateiteh, atu nama koe a pha teh, na lung sut a pout. Na tek teh, na ngaihmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na barilawa e hoi na kâuepkhai e nahoehmaw, kakuep e lamthung hah na ngaihawi e nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atu pouk haw, kayonhoehe apimaw kahmakata boi vai. Hat hoehpawiteh, tamikalan hah nâmaw tâkhawng e lah ao boi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kahmanae dawkvah payonpakainae, talai kanawk teh runae ka tu e ni doeh ouk a a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cathut e kâha dawk a kahma awh teh, a lungkhueknae kâha dawk be a kak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sendek huk e pawlawk hoi, ka matheng poung e sendektan kanaw e a hâ hah a kâkhoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ca hane ao hoeh dawkvah Sendek matawngnaw a kamlum teh, Sendek manu e a canaw teh koung kâkapek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atu arulahoi kai koe lawk a pha teh, ka hnâ ni arulahoi pouk e hah a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Karoumcalah a i awh lahun navah, karum vah vision hah pouk lahun navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Takinae hoi pâyawnae kai koe a pha. Ka hrunaw pueng koung kâhlehlawk sak e han,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hottelah muitha teh, ka hmalah a kâhlai teh, ka muen rueng a thaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote muitha hah a kangdue teh, ka kamnuek e hah kapek thai hoeh. Ka mithmu vah hno buet touh a kamnue, duem ao teh lawk hah ka thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka dout thai e tami heh, Cathut hlak vah a lan thai maw, tami heh kasakkung hlak vah a thoung thai na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sannaw patenghai kâuepkhai hoeh niteh, kalvantaminaw hai na payon tet pouh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />amhru im dawk kho ka sak niteh, a kungpui teh, vaiphu lah ao teh, ahnimanaw teh, khakbara ni patenghai a tâ thai e hah bangtelamaw hoe a yuem thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amon hoi tangmin totouh katipcalah a kâbawng teh, apinihai tek laipalah a yungyoe a kahma awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahawi poungnae naw hai koung takhoe lah ao teh, lungangnae awm laipalah be a due awh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atu kaw haw, na ka pato hane ao awh han vaimoe. Kathounge tami, nâ lah maw na kamlang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, lungkhueknae ni tamipathu a thei teh, utsinnae ni kamawngrame a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami ni khawngyang a pabo e hah ka hmu, hateiteh kho a saknae hmuen hah thoe tangka bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A capanaw teh, a hlout nahane awm hoeh, longkha koe a rawp awh vaiteh, a katin awh han. Ka rungngang hane awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a von ka hlam e ni a a e cang hah be a ca pouh teh, pâkhingum e patenghai hnopainaw hah a lawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, khangnae teh talai dawk hoi ka tho e nahoeh. Rucatnae hai talai dawk hoi ka tho e na hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmaitali kahlun lah a luen e patetlah, tami teh rucat hane doeh a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hateiteh, kai niteh, Cathut ka tawng vaiteh, ka rucatnae teh Cathut e hmalah ka dei pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A bawilennae hoi dei thai hoeh e, touk thai hoeh e, kângairunae kasakthaie koe vah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Talai dawk kho a rak sak teh, law dawk tui a lawng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kangduenae hmuen ka rahnoum e hah, a rasang sak teh, lung kamathoutnaw hah, roumnae hmuen dawk a luen sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huenghai kaawmnaw khokhangnae hah a kahma sak teh, a kut hoi a noe e naw koung a raphoe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami lungkaang huenghai kaawm e hah, a thoumthainae ni a man awh teh, huenghai kaawm naw e khokhangnae hah, amamouh dawk tang a pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kanîthun angnae dawk hmonae hoi a kâhmo awh teh, kanî tuengtalueng thun nah tangmin e patetlah thupthup a payam awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hateiteh, tahloi hoi tami ka voutthoup e hah a rungngang teh, athakaawme taminaw e apâhni hoi a kut ni a rungngang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka roedengnaw ni ngaihawinae a tawn awh teh, lanhoehnae ni a pahni a cakuep pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khenhaw! Cathut ni a toun e tami teh, tami a lung kahawi e doeh. Hatdawkvah Athakasaipounge ni phepnae teh, noutna laipalah awm hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ama ni a hem teh, a hmâ hah ama ni a kawm pouh. Ama ni a hmâ a ca sak teh, a kut hoi a dam sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama ni runae taruk touh dawk hoi a tâco sak e dueng khout laipalah, sari touh thung dawk hoi hai kahawihoehe ni tek awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama ni takang duenae thung hoi a ratang awh vaiteh, taran um e tahloi thaonae thung hoi a ratang awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lawkthoeumkha thung hoi hro lah na o vaiteh, rawkphainae a pha torei teh, na taket mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rawkphainae hoi takangnae na panui sin vaiteh, talai e sarangnaw hah na taket mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kahrawng e talungnaw hoi rei kambawng vaiteh, kahrawng e sarangmathengnaw hoi karoumcalah na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na onae rim dawk karoumcalah na o e hah na panue han. Na khosaknae hah na khet navah voutthoupnae banghai awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na ca catoun moiapap hane hah a panue vaiteh, nange na miphunnaw talai dawk phovai patetlah ao e hah na hmu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Atueng pha toteh cabong taoung e patetlah na kumcue toteh, phuen koe na pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khenhaw! heteheh ka pakhingpalang awh teh, kalan e doeh ka tho. Thaihaw, nama hane doeh tie hah panuek, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Oe, ka kângairunae heh, yawcu dawk khing haw pawiteh, ka khang e runae naw hai, yawcu khingnae dawk phat naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, palang teng e sadi hlak hai a ri han doeh. Hatdawkvah ka dei payon toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Athakasaipounge ni a ka e pala teh kai thung vah ao, ahnimae a sue hah ka muitha ni a nei. Cathut takinae hah ka hmalah a kamnue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kahrawng e la ni hram a papnae koe a hram boimaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Atuinae kaawm hoeh e bu teh palawi laipalah ca thai han maw. Aduirakei ka pangaw e dawk atuinae bangmaw kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hringnae ni, a tek han a ngai hoeh e, kai hanelah, panuettho e rawcanaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Oe, kahei e heh ka hmawt haw pawiteh, Cathut ni ngai poung e na poe haw pawiteh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pahren lahoi Cathut ni vek na khei haw na seh, A kut na pho sin nateh vitkatip lah, na tâtueng haw naseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hottelah nakunghai, ka lungmawngnae ka tawn rah. Patawnae ni na tha hoeh nakunghai ka lunghawi han rah. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami kathounge lawk hah kâhrawk mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangpatete thaonae maw ka tawn teh, ka ngaihawi han rah. Ka poutnae hah, banglamaw ao teh, ka hringnae ni a saw sak han rae te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thaonae heh lungsong thaonae lah maw ao. Ka takthai he rahum lah maw a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka thung vah kabawmkung awmhoeh namaw, ka kuepcingnae naw pueng kai koehoi be kampuen toung nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangpueng katetthai takinae a ceitakhai nakunghai, patawnae ka khang e koevah, a hui koehoi a lungmanae kamnue sak hane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hmaunawnghanaw teh palang tui patetlah yuengyoe kampuen e doeh, dawngdengca dawk kahmat e palang tui patetlah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tui a kamkak e kecu dawkvah a tamang teh, a thungvah ka kâhrawk e tadamtui patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abet torei teh, be kahma awh teh, a kâan torei teh amamae hmuen koehoi kahmakata awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amamae a lamthung dawk hoi a kamlang awh teh, nâ lahai cet laipalah kahmakata awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Teman miphun kahlawng kacetnaw ni a khet awh teh, Sheba kahlawng kacetnaw ni a ngaihawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ngâhawi awh dawkvah, a lungpout awh. Hawvah a pha awh torei teh, a kaya awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, atuvah banglahai na tho awh hoeh toe. Takikatho e na hmu awh teh, na lung a puen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na poe awh haw, telah ka dei boimaw, hoeh pawiteh, na hnopainaw dawk hoi, kai na ratang nahanelah poe awh ka ti boimaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hoeh pawiteh, ka tarannaw e kut dawk hoi na rungngang awh haw, ka ti boimaw, hoeh pawiteh, kai ka hnephnap e koehoi na ratang awh ka ti boimaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na cangkhai awh haw, duem ka o han, lawkkalan hah na panuek sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lannae teh, banghloimaw a tha ao. Hateiteh, na lawknaw ni bangmaw a kamceng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lawk ka dei e naw heh yonpen hane maw na ngai awh. Ngaihawinae ka tawn hoeh e tami ni a dei e lawk teh, kahlî patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangmouh niteh, naranaw hah na ka pacekpahlek awh, na huinaw hanelah tangkom na tai pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, pahren lahoi khen awh haw, bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmae hmalah ka lai kathout mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ban awh nateh, lanhoehnae hah awm sak awh hanh, atu totouh ka kangdout e ka lannae heh tawm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka lai dawk lanhoehnae ao maw, katui hoi katui hoeh e na kapekkaboe thai awh hoeh maw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Talaivan dawkvah tami hanelah thaw ka ru e thaw a onae tueng ouk ao nahoehmaw, a hninnaw hai kutkapânaw e hnin patetlah awm hoeh namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tâhlip dik ka doun e san patetlah, kutkapânaw ni kutphu hmu han a ngai hawi e patetlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang hoeh e dawk thapa moikapap lah ka hno teh, khohmo runae naw hah kai hanelah ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka i na koehoi, nâtuek maw ka thaw han. Karum heh baw nah lawiseh ka ti. Bangkongtetpawiteh, khodai totouh kamhmei kamlang hoi ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka takthai teh, pâri hoi songnawng ni muen na kayo teh, ka vuen hai cupei teh koung a kâhnoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hninnaw teh, hnikawngnae yawngyen hlak hai a rang teh, ngaihawinae awm laipalah a loum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hringnae teh kahlî doeh tie hah pahnim hanh, ka mit ni ahawinae bout hmawt mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kahmawtnaw e mit ni bout na hmawt mahoeh toe. Na mit ka tak dawk a um navah, kaawm mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tâmai kâhin teh, a kahma e patetlah, duenae tangkom thung ka cet e ni bout ban mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A im vah bout ban hoeh vaiteh, a onae hmuen ni ama teh panuek mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ka pahni ka cakuep mahoeh. Ka muitha rek na laihoi ka dei vaiteh, kakhat e ka hringnae hoi lai ka roe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai teh, talî lah maw ka tho. Nahoeh pawiteh, talî dawk e khorui lah maw ka tho teh, na karingkung hah na ta pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ikhun ni ka ngai a mawng sak han. Ka yannae ikhun ni ka phuenangnae a roum sak han telah ka ti navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tangmin mang lahoi na pakhi teh, kamnuenae lahoi kai na kalue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hringnae ni ka lahuen a kara hoi duenae hah, ka takthai ni a ngaihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hringnae he ka hnueai teh, yungyoe ka hring mahoeh. Kama dueng na awm sak awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka hringnae teh a kahû lah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami he banglamaw ao teh, hettelah na tawmrasang teh, a lathueng vah na lungthin pou na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amon tangkuem na tho sin teh, nâtuek e atueng dawk hai pou na tanouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nâtuek hai na kamlang takhai laipalah, pou na khet vaiteh, ka tamtui ka padoun nahai ka madueng na tat hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yonnae ka tawn maw, oe taminaw ka ring e, nang lathueng vah bangmaw ka sak. Bangdawkmaw na hmaitung vah telah na o sak teh, kama hoi kama hnori lah na o sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangdawkmaw na kâ ka eknae hah na ngaithoum laipalah, ka payonpakainae hah na lat pouh hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, vaiphu dawk ka i vaiteh, nama ni kai na tawng han, hatei kaawm mahoeh toe atipouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shuhi tami Bildad ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nâsittouh maw he e hnonaw heh dei han, na pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e lawk hah athakaawme kahlî patetlah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cathut ni kalan hoeh lah lawk a ceng boimaw, nahoeh pawiteh, Athakasaipounge ni, lannae a kamlang takhai boimaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na capanaw ni ama taranlahoi yon awh pawiteh, kâtapoenae kecu dawk a tâkhawng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cathut hah atangcalah hoi, na tawng teh, Athakasaipounge koevah, kâheinae na sak pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamikathoung tamikalan lah na awm pawiteh, nang hanelah atu roeroe thaw vaiteh, lanae hmuen koe hawinae na coe sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kamtawngnae a thoung nakunghai, na poutnae a len katang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, pahrennae hoi a yan e hnonaw hah pakhingpalang haw, na mintoenaw ni a hmu e hnonaw hah pouk haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, paduem e tami la o awh teh, banghai panuek awh hoeh. Bangdawk tetpawiteh, talai van e hnin tha naw teh, tâhlip patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahnimae lungthin thung hoi ka tâcawt e lawknaw ni, na dei pouh awh teh, na cangkhai hoeh namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuinawk laipalah lungpum a roung thai han namaw. Tui laipalah capi teh a roung thai han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hring nah tâtueng hoeh nakunghai, alouke akungnaw hlak palang a kamyai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cathut kapahnimnaw e a lamthung teh, hot patetlah ao. Tami kahawihoehnaw e ngaihawinae teh a kahma han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kâuepkhai awh e teh, tâkhawng pouh lah ao han, a kâuepkhainae teh, Bombarui patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A im dawk a kamngawi ei kangdout thai hoeh. Kacakcalah a kuet ei pou cak thai ma hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khobetnae koe dikkahringcala a roung teh, a kangnaw ni takha koung tahloi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tangpha ni talung khakdeng teh, talung um vah a tangpha a payang nahane a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amae hmuen koehoi phawk lah ao torei teh, pou kacak mahoeh, telah a kâpahnawt han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khenhaw! het hateh, lunghawinae lamthung lah a o, talai dawk hoi aloukenaw hah a pâw han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khenhaw! Cathut ni toun han kaawm hoeh e na tâkhawng hoeh vaiteh, thoe ka sak e teh kangdout sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kâko teh panuinae hoi akawi sak vaiteh, na pahni hai lunghawinae lawk hoi akawi sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang kahmuhmanaw hah yeiraipo sak vaiteh, tamikathoutnaw e rim teh awm mahoeh toe telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job ni bout a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hetheh doeh tie hah atangcalah ka panue, hateiteh, Cathut e hmalah bangtelamaw tami teh a lan thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama oun han ka ngai e awm pawiteh, avai 1,000 touh dawkvah vai touh boehai pathung thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cathut teh, lungkaang poung e, athakaawme thayung lah ao. Ama taranlahoi lung ka patak sak e, a lam ka cawn e apimaw kaawm boi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Monnaw hah a puen teh, a lungkhueknae hoi a pathung torei teh, panuek awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Talai a onae hmuen koehoi a kâhuet teh, a khomnaw hah koung a kâhuet sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kanî hah kâ a poe teh, tâcawt hoeh. Âsi angnae hah muen a ramuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama dueng lahoi kalvan hah a ramuk teh, tuipui tuicapa van a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama ni Latum, Kangduetaphai, Baritca, hoi akalae âsinaw hah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Be panue thai hoeh e hnokalen e hai, touk thai hoeh e kângairu hnonaw hah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka teng vah a cei ei ama teh, ka hmawt hoeh. Na ceihlawi e hai ka panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama ni lat pawiteh, apinimaw a haw pouh thai han. Apinimaw bangmaw na sak, atipouh thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lungkhueknae dawk hoi, Cathut ni kamlang takhai mahoeh toe. A khok rahim vah tami kâoup e kabawmnaw teh a tabut awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kai ni ama teh bangtelamaw, ka pathung thai han. Ama oun nahanelah, bangpatet e lawk maw kârawi han
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangtelah kalan nakunghai, ama teh ka pathung thai mahoeh. Kai lawkcengkung koe pahrennae doeh ka hei hnawn han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kaw pawiteh, ama ni na pato han. Ama ni ka lawk na thai pouh hane ka yuem hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kahlî kathout ni na hmang teh, a khuekhaw awm laipalah ka hmânaw hah a kampai sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka kâha thai laipalah, reithai hoi na kawi sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thasainae dawkvah ama teh, athakaawme lah ao. A lannae, kong dawk tetpawiteh, lawkcengnae dawk apinimaw ka hnin hah a khoe thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka kuep nakunghai, ka pahni ni yon na pen han, tanouk hanelah kaawm hoeh nakunghai, ka lanhoehnae hah a kamnue sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toun hoeh nahanlah ka o. Hateiteh, ka kâpanuek hoeh, ka hringnae heh ka hnueai toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Be kâvan doeh. Hat dawk nahoehmaw, tamikathoutnaw hoi toun han kaawm hoeh e hoi, be raphoe han telah ka dei vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hemnae ni vai touh hoi thet boipawiteh, kayonhoehe khangnae teh, a panuikhai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Talai heh tamikathout e kut dawk poe lah ao teh, a lawkcengkungnaw e minhmai a ramuk. Ahni hoehpawiteh, api han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hninnaw hateh, ka yawng e hlak hai hoe a rang, a kamleng awh teh, hawinae hmawt awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Karang poung e lawng patetlah a khup teh, Mataw ni moithang a ka cawp e patetlah a rang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka phuenangnae ka pahnim vaiteh, ka lungmathoenae minhmai he ka ta vaiteh, minhmai kapancala ka o han ka ti navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka khangnae naw pueng heh, makkhak ka taki teh, tamikayon hoeh e lah na pouk hoeh langvaih tie hah ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Yon pen e lah kaawm pawiteh, bangdawkmaw ahrawnghrang e meng ka tawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tadamtui hoi ka kamhluk nakunghai, ka kut heh sapet hoi ka kamsin nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tangdong dawk na tâkhawng teh, ka khohna ni patenghai na panuet han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, lawkcengnae koe rei cet vaiteh, ama teh ka pathung thai nahanelah, ama teh tami lah tho hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Maimouh roi e van kut ka toung hanelah, maimae rahak laicei awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kai koe e sonron lat naseh taki a thonae ni na taket sak hanh seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ama taket laipalah lawk hah ka dei han. Hateiteh, kai koevah hottelah bout awm kalawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kamae ka hringnae ka panuet. Ka phuenangnae ka pâpho ngala han. Ka hringnae a rek hoi lawk ka dei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cathut koe yon na pen hanh, bangdawkmaw na taran, na hmawt sak haw, telah ka ti han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami repcoungroe lahoi na kutsak tami hah dudam teh, tamikathoutnaw khokhang e hnâbokhaie heh, ahawi telah na pouk maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Takthai e mit maw na tawn, tami ni a hmu e patetlah maw na hmu van maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Namae hninnaw hai tami e hnin patetlah maw ao. Namae kumnaw teh, tami e hnin patetlah maw ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tamikathout lah ka ohoehnae hah na panue eiteh, na kut dawk hoi ka rungngang thai e awm hoeh tie hah na panue nahlangva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka payonpakai e naw hah na tawng teh, ka yonnae hah na pâphue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Namae na kut hoi na sak teh, ka kuepcingcalah na pathoup. Hateiteh, namae kut ni bout na raphoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nama ni talai e na sak tie hah na pahnim hoeh nahan ka kâhei, vaiphu lah maw bout na coung sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nama ni sanutui patetlah na rabawk teh, sanutui kamkak patetlah na pahlawm nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nama ni ka vuen hoi takthai na ramuk. Ka hru hoi ka tharui hoi na caksak nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nama ni ka hringnae hoi pahrennae na poe teh, na khetyawtnae ni ka muitha teh a lungmawng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hete hnonaw heh na lungthin thung vah na hro teh, namae thung vah ao tie hah ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka yon pawiteh nama ni na panue han. Ka payonpakai e dawk hoi na hlout sak hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tamikathout lah kaawm pawiteh, yawthoe lah ka o han, tamikalan lah ka o nakunghai, minhmai kahawi kahmawt thai mahoeh. Kayayeirai hoi runae hoi kakawi e la ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kâoup pawiteh, ka matheng e Sendek patetlah, hmâ na ca sak. Kai taranlahoi takikathopounge bout na kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kai na ka taran hane ka panuekkhaie patuen patuen na tha teh, kai dawk na lungkuephoehnae na pung sak. Dumyennae hoi tarantuknae hah, kai koe pou ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangdawkmaw camo im dawk hoi na tâcosak. Oe apinihai na hmawt laipalah kadout boi pawiteh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kaawmhoehe patetlah ka o han ei, Camo im thung hoi phuen lah ceikhai lah ka o han ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hninnaw heh, ka younca e nahoehmaw. Ka cei vaiteh bout ka ban thai hoeh nahanlah, duenae tâhlip hoi hmonae ram dawk ka cei hoehnahlan vah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungmawngnae dawngdeng hai ka hmu nahanelah, ka kâhat pawiteh, ka mahmawk na awm sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama lungpouk ka hmawt e, kingkahmawt e ram, duenae tâhlip patetlah, banghai ka awmhoeh e, angnae hai hmonae patetlah a onae hmuen koe, telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naamath tami Zophar ni a pathung e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hettelae lawk kapap e heh pathung laipalah ao thai han namaw, Lawk moikapap ka dei e pueng ni maw kayonhoehe la o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na dei e lawk hrawnghrang ni, tami a roum sak thai han namaw, Tami na panuikhai nah buet touh ni hai yue mahoeh namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka yuemnae teh a thoung. Na mithmu vah kathoung telah na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hateiteh, oe Cathut ni na dei pouh seh, nang kâtaran lahoi pahni ang naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama ni lungangnae arulawk hah na hmu sak yawkaw han, bangkongtetpawiteh, na lungangnae alet hni touh apap. Hatdawkvah na payonpakai e dawk hoi kayounhnawn lah Cathut ni a sak tie panuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kadungpoung e Cathut e hno hah na pakhingpalang thai na maw, Athakasaipounge coungnae hah na tawng teh koung na hmuthai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kalvan hlak hai a rasang teh, nang ni bangmaw na sak thai, Phuennaw hlak hai hoe adung teh, nang ni bangmaw na panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A bangnuenae teh, talai hlak hai asaw. Tuipui hlak hai hoe akaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A man teh thongim dawk paung hoi lawkceng hanelah pâkhueng pawiteh, apinimaw ahni teh a rungngang thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, huenghai ao a e hah a panue, thoe sak e hai a hmu. Ama ni pouk laipalah maw ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kahrawng e laca patetlah tami a khe torei teh, tamipathu teh a lungang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lungthin hah kârakueng nateh Cathut koe na kut dâw haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kut dawk na payonpakai e awm boipawiteh, ahlanae koe tâkhawng haw. Kathoute hah na im dawk awm hanh seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hottelah tounnae awm laipalah, na minhmai hah a kamnue han doeh. Kacakcalah na o vaiteh, na taket mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, na rucatnae hah na pahnim vaiteh, poun ka lawng e tui patetlah pahnim hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hringnae teh kanîthun e hlak hai hoe a ang han, a hmonae hah amom patetlah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Karoumcalah na o han, bangkongtetpawiteh, ngaihawinae ao. Na tengpam e hno na sung nakunghai karoumcalah na kâhat han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na i vaiteh, apinihai tâsuenae na poe mahoeh, tami moikapap ni nang koe a kâhei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hateiteh, tamikathoutnaw e mit teh, dawn vaiteh, hlout awh mahoeh. A ngaihawi awh e hringnae teh a sung awh han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lunghringnae awm laipalah nangmanaw nahoehmaw tami lungkaangnaw lah na kaawm awh heh, namamouh hoi lungangnae teh rei a due han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hateiteh, nangmouh patetlah panuethainae ka tawn van. Nangmouh hlak vah hoe ka rahnoum hoeh. Het patet e hno panue hoeh e apimaw kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai teh, huikonaw ni panuikhaie lah ka o teh, Cathut a kaw teh, ama ni a pathung e kai heh, tamikalan, toun han awmhoeh, a panuikhaie kâhmo e lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kanawmcalah kaawmnaw e khopouknae dawkvah, yawthoenae heh panuikhainae lah ao teh, a kamthui nahanlah coungkacoe paloung pouh e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dingcanaw e rim law teh a hmacawn teh, Cathut lungkhueksakkungnaw law teh a roum awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh Cathut ni a kut hoi a kawkhik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hateiteh, atu moithangnaw koe pacei nateh, na cangkhai awh han doeh. Kalvan e kamleng e tavanaw hai pacei haw, na dei pouh han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hoeh pawiteh, talai koe vah dei pouh haw, na cangkhai han doeh, Talî dawk e tanganaw ni nangmouh teh kamcengcalah na panue sak han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hete hnonaw dawk BAWIPA ni a sak tie hah, ka panuek hoeh e nangmouh thung dawk apimaw kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kut dawk hringnae katawnnaw puenghoi, tami pueng e kâhanae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kâko ni rawca a patek e patetlah hnâ ni lawk hah a tanouk nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kacuenaw koe lungangnae ao teh, a kumcue torei teh, panuethainae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahni koe lungangnae hoi thaonae ao. Ahni ni khokhangnae hoi panuethainae a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hno heh raphoe hnukkhu hoi teh, bout sak thai hoeh toe, tami khak paung hoi teh tâco thai nahan a ru toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tui hah pahak hoi teh a ke toe, tui bout tha torei teh talai dawk bout a kamuem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama koe thasainae hoi roumnae a onae hoi ka payonsakkung teh amae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khokhangkungnaw hah be kahma lah a ceikhai teh, lawkcengkung hah be a pathu sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrangnaw kateknae hah a rathap pouh teh, a kengnaw dawk taisawm a kâyeng sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawinaw hah takcaici lah a hrawi teh, athakaawme taminaw hah a rawp sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kâuepkhai awh e lawknaw hah a hnoun pouh teh, kacuenaw e panuethainae hah a takhoe pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawinaw lathueng vah dudamnae a rabawk teh, tami tha kaawm naw hah kutcaici lah ao sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmonae thung hoi kadung poung e hno koung a kamnue sak, Duenae tâhlip hah angnae dawk a tâcokhai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Miphunnaw hah a len sak teh bout a raphoe. Miphunnaw hah a kâthap sak teh bout a hrawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Talai e tamihu kahrawinaw hah panuethainae naw a kahma sak teh, kahrawngum lamthung a ohoehnae koe a kâva sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Angnae awm laipalah hmonae thung thupthup a payam awh, ka parui e tami patetlah rawraw a cu sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khenhaw! he e hnonaw pueng heh, ka mit hoi ka hmu. Ka hnâ ni a thai teh a thaipanuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na panue e teh, kai ni hai ka panue van. Nangmouh hlak hoe ka rahnoum hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hateiteh, Athakasaipounge koevah, ka dei haw nei, Cathut hoi rei pouk hanelah ka ngai poung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hateiteh, nangmouh teh laithoe ka dei e lah na o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Duem awm awh haw, hottelah pawiteh, na lungangnae la ao han ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka pouknae heh thai awh haw, ka pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e kâheinae heh alawkpui lah pouk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cathut hanelah kahawihoeh poung lah a dei awh han maw, Ahni hanelah laithoe na dei awh han maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahni hanelah kapeknae na tawn awh na maw, Cathut teh na oun awh han maw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama ni nangmanaw hah rek na toun awh pawiteh, ahawi han namaw. Tami a panuikhaie patetlah ama hah na panuikhai han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arulahoi kapeknae na tawn awh pawiteh, ama ni na yue awh roeroe han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahawinae ni na lungpuen sak awh mahoeh maw. Taki thonae hah nangmouh dawkvah bawt mahoeh maw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namamae cingthuinae lawk hah, hraba cingthuinae lawk doeh. Na kângainae khorapan hai tangpung hoi pacawp rumram e la doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Duem awm awh haw, lawk na dei sak haw. Ka tak dawk banghai phat na yawkaw seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangdawkmaw ka tak hah ka hâ hoi ka kei vaiteh, ka hringnae hah ka kut dawk ka ta han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na ka thet nakunghai ama teh kâuepkhai han doeh. Hottelah nakunghai a hmalah yonthanae lawk bout ka dei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama teh kaie rungngangnae lah ao han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tamitongthoenaw teh a hmalah tho thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka dei e heh kahawicalah thai awh haw, ka pâpho e heh na hnâ dawk kâen sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khenhaw! ka dei e kong dawkvah yo ka pouk e doeh toe, yon na ngaithoum han tie hah ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Apimaw na ka oun hane kaawm. Awm boipawiteh, duem ka o vaiteh, ka due yawkaw han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kai dawk hno kahni touh dueng heh sak hanh yawkaw, hottelah pawiteh nang koehoi kâhrawk mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kai koehoi na kut hah ahla poungnae koe kampuen sak, taki na thonae e ni ka lungpuen sak hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hottelah pawiteh na kaw nah na pathung han. Hoeh pawiteh lawk na dei sak haw, nama ni na pathung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka payonpakai e hoi ka yonnae hah nâyittouh maw apap vai, kâtapoenae hoi ka yonnae hah na panuek sak haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangdawkmaw na minhmai na hro teh, na taran lah na pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kahlî ni a palek e lengle teh, na pâlei han na maw, Cakong hah na pâlei han namaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kakhat e hno hah, kai na taranlahoi na thut teh, ka nawca nah payonpakai e naw hah na phu sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka khok hlong na buet teh, ka lamthung pueng hah kahnaicalah na khet. Ka khoksampha hanelah rui khoup na payang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami teh kahmawn e hno patetlah atum teh, khakbara ni a ca e hnicu patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Napui ni a khe e tami teh, a hring kaduem ni teh runae hoi kakawi e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pei patetlah a kamdat teh bout a kamyai. Tâhlip patetlah a kampuen teh, bout awm hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hot patetlae dawkvah, na mit na padai teh, lawkcengnae dawk nama koe na ceikhai han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Apinimaw kathounghoehe dawk hoi, na thoung e a la thai han, apinihai lat thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hninnaw hah atueng khoe hnukkhu hoi, thapa nâyittouh maw tie hah na kut dawk ao. A tapuet thai hoeh nahanelah khori hoi a ngang pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kut ka pâ e tami patetlah a hninnaw aloum totouh, a kâhat thai nahanelah ahni teh kamlang takhai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, thing teh tâtueng nakunghai bout a bawt hane letlang hngaihawinae ao rah. A cakang bout a bawt han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Talai dawk a khawngyang kahmawn nakunghai kadout nakunghai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tui kahû dawk bout bawt vaiteh, ung e patetlah a cakang a tâco han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hateiteh, tami teh a due hoi pakawp teh a kahma toe, tami teh a kâha a baw teh namaw ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Talî dawk e tui a kahma teh, tuipui hai a hak teh be a ke.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hot patetlah tami hai a yan teh thaw hoeh toe. Kalvannaw ao hoeh totouh hai kâhlaw hoe toe. Hoeh pawiteh, muet a inae koehoi kâhlaw mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Oe phuen koe na hrawk sak haw, na lungkhueknae a roum hoeh roukrak na hrawk haw, atueng hah na pouk pouh nateh, na pahnim hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka kâthungnae atueng a pha totouh, tami dout pawiteh, bout a hring han namaw Ka ru e ka thawnaw dawk hoi ka ring han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kaw vaiteh, na pato han. Nama ni na kut hoi na sak e teh na pahren han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka khokhnuknaw pueng be na touk. Hateiteh, ka yonnae naw hah na khen pouh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kâtapoenae hah, yawngya thung khakkin e naw lah ao teh, ka payonpakai e hah na ramuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hateiteh, mon katim e patetlah, talung teh a onae hmuen koehoi puen e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tui ni talung pekpacin e patetlah, tuikalen ni talai kahawi a ceikhai e patetlah, tami e ngaihawi e hah na raphoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama teh poe na tâ teh, be a kahma awh. A mei na kâthungsak teh, alouklah na cei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A capanaw a tawmrasang e hah panuek awh hoeh. Ahnimouh pabo lah o awh e hai kâhmawt thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hateiteh, a takthai hah patawnae dawk ao vaiteh, a hringnae ni ama a khui han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Teman tami Eliphaz ni a pathung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat navah, Tami a lungkaang ni ahrawnghrang panuenae hoi maw a pathung han. Kanîtholae kahlî hoi a von a paha sak han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang patopatang kaawm hoeh e lawk hno lahoi thoseh, hawinae ka sak thai hoeh e lawk ni a poukkhai han maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cathut takinae hoi ama koe ratoum e hah na ngang pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, na payonpakainae ni, na pahni hah a cangkhai teh, huenghai onae lawk hah na kârawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kai ni nang yon na pen hoeh. Na pahni roeroe ni doeh yon na pen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmaloe poung khe e lah maw na o, hoeh pawiteh monnaw ao hoehnahlan vah sak e lah na o toung maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cathut e khokhangnae hah na panue toung maw, Lungangnae he nang hane dueng lah maw ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kaimouh ni ka panue hoeh e bangmaw na panue, kaimouh dawk kaawm hoeh e bangmaw na panue thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaimouh thung dawkvah sampo ka po e hoi kacuepoung e, na pa hlak hai kacuehnawn e ka o awh kaima.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cathut ni a dei e lungmawngnae lawk kanem teh nang hanlah a patawpoung maw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang kecu dawk maw, na lungthin ni na kahmakhai, bang kecu dawk maw avangvanglah pou na hmaiet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na muitha ni Cathut taranlahoi pou a kamlang teh, hot patet e lawknaw na pahni dawk hoi na tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami teh banglamaw ao teh, a thoung thai han. Napui ni a khe e teh, banglamaw ao teh, a lan thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tamikathoungnaw patenghai, Cathut ni kâuepkhai hoeh. A mithmu vah kalvan patenghai thounghoeh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Panuet ka tho e, kakhin e, payonpakainae hah, tui patetlah ka net e teh, banghloimaw hoe kathounghoehe la ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thaihaw, ka dei vai, ka hmu e hah ka pâpho han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami a lungkaangnaw ni ouk a dei e mintoe koehoi e hmu e hno a hro awh hoeh e hah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahnimouh dueng a poe e ram, ram alouknaw a othaihoenae hah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw ni a hring na thung patawnae a khang. Amamouh kum yit touh rep kacuengroenaw koe a hro.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Takitho e pawlawk hah amamae hnâ ni a thai teh, hnopai a tawn nah, ka raphoe hane naw ni a thosin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmonae thung hoi kamlang hane hah yuem hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni teh tahloi ni a ring toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ca hane tawng hanelah a kâva teh, nâmaw hote teh ao telah a ti. Hmonae hnin teh a kut dawk a pha toe tie hah a panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rucatnae hoi kângairunae ni a lungpuen sak, tarantuk hanelah coungkacoe kaawm e siangpahrang patetlah tâ e la ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut taranlahoi a kut a dâw teh, Athakasaipounge taranlahoi kâoupnae hoi a kâroe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bahling katha poung e hoi, lung ka patak poung e lahoi Cathut tuk hanelah a yawng sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Athaw ni a minhmai muen a ramuk teh, a keng thouk kathâw nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />kingkadi e khopui dawk kho a sak teh, apinihai a ohoehnae, kingdi e kho dawk ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tawnta mahoeh, hoeh pawiteh, a tawnta e hnopainaw kangning mahoeh, hoeh pawiteh a tawn e hah talai dawk pungdaw mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hmonae thung hoi tâcawt mahoeh. Hmaipalai ni a kangnaw hah a kak han, a pahni dawk e kahlî hoi be a kahma sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amahoima a kâdum teh, bang hoeh e hah kâuep han seh, bangkongtetpawiteh, a tawkphu teh banghai bang nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Atueng akuep hoehnahlan vah, kuep sak lah ao awh vaiteh, akangnaw hah naw mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Misurkangnaw patetlah ka hmin hoeh rae a paw a sarut totouh kahû en vai teh, Olive thing patetlah a pei hah koung a sarut han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tamikathoutnaw hoi kamyawng e teh, caici lah ao han. Tadawngnae hoi sak e im teh, hmai ni be a kak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kahawi hoeh e hah a vawn teh, bang hoeh e hah a khe awh. A von dawk laithoe a vawn awh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Job ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hot patet e hno teh, moikapap ka thai toe, nangmouh abuemlae lungpahawinae haiyah thathoenae hrum doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kahlî lawk teh poutnae ao maw, Hettelah pathung hane bang ni maw na tha a hmei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kangduenae hmuen heh na kangduenae hmuen lah awm pawiteh, kai ni hai na dei awh e hah ka dei thai van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hateiteh, ka pahni ni tha na o sak awh han. Ka pahni dawk hoi lungroumnae lawk ni na lungmathoenae a kahma sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lawk ka dei nakunghai ka lungmathoenae roum sak thai hoeh. Duem ka o nakunghai bang alânae awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hateiteh, ama ni na tawn sak teh, ka huikonaw puenghai kingdi sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nama ni khakkatek teh, hot ni kai hanelah kapanuekkhaikung lah ao. Ka kamsoenae ni yon na pen teh, hot ni ka minhmai dawk ka panuek khai e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lungkhueknae ni rekrek na sei teh, na hmuhma. A hâkam na kata sin teh, ka taran ni na hmaiet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pahni na ang sin awh teh, lungroukatetlah ka tangboung dawk na tambei. Kai na taran hanelah cungtalah a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cathut ni Cathut banglah ka ngaihoeh naw koe na pâseng, tamikathoutnaw kut dawk na tâkhawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kanawmcalah ka o eiteh, ama ni rekrek na bawng. Ka lahuen dawk na man teh, bengbeng na kahuet teh, rek ka kâbawng, kai teh tâkhawng hanelah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahnie pala kakanaw ni na kalup awh. Ka lung poukkayawng lah na ka teh, na pahren hoeh, talai dawk ka hmu e tui hah a ka rabawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hmâ dawkvah patuen patuen hmâ na paca ka pahngawpahrak e ransanaw patetlah na cusin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka vuen dawkvah, burihni ka khui sin teh, ka lû teh vaiphu dawk ka hruek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ka lawi vah ka minhmai a paling teh, ka mit dawk duenae tâhlip ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka kut dawk kahawihoehe hno kasake awm hoeh. Ka ratoumnae teh a thoung ei te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Oe talai, ka thipaling heh ramuk han haw. Ka kanae ni kâhatnae hmuen tawn hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Atu patenghai, kapanuekkhaikung teh a rasangnae koevah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka huinaw ni na dudam awh. Cathut koe ka mitphi a lawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami ni imri hanelah, a kâhei pouh e patetlah, oe Cathut koe na kâhet pouh hane awm haw pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kum nâsittouh abaw hoehnahlan, bout ban hoeh nae lamthung dawk ka cei han telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hringnae hah a kâbawng teh, ka hninnaw hai aloum toe. Kai hanelah phuen hai coungkacoe lah ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka panuikhai e hah kai koe awm awh hoeh maw. Ka lung ka khuek sak e lawk ka mit a um nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nama dueng lahoi kai hanelah, lawkkamnae hah sak, kut na ka man e teh api han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, panuethainae dawk hoi, a lungthin hah na hro. Hatdawkvah ahnimouh teh, na rasangsak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A huiko koe dumnae hoi oupnae lawk ka dei e teh, a canaw e mit totouh a mawm han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hateiteh, tamimaya koe kâpankhai rumram hanelah na sak teh, ahnimae hmalah tamtui pathasin rumram hanelah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lungmathoenae kecu dawk ka mit totouh a mawm teh, ka takthai pueng heh tâhlip rumram la ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamikalannaw ni hetheh kângairu ati awh han, kayonhoehe taminaw ni cathutlaipa e taminaw a taran awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hateiteh, tamikalan ni a lamthung hah a kuet vaiteh, ka thoung e kut ka tawn e teh hoe a thao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hateiteh, abuemlahoi pahren lahoi bout ban awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmouh thung dawkvah tamilungkaang ka hmawt pawm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hninnaw hai aloum toe. Ka lungthung hoi ka pouk teh, ka noe e naw hai ayawmyin lah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tangmin hah kanîthun lah a kâthungsak teh, khohmo thung hai angnae a hnai toe ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Phuen hah ka im patetlah ka ring teh, hmonae thung vah ikhun ka sak pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />rawkphainae hah apa doeh ka ti teh, tangraet koe nang teh anu hoi ka tawncanu doeh ka tetpawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka ngaihawinae teh, nâ lah maw ao vai, ka ngaihawinae teh, apinimaw a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Duenae kho takhang koe lah, a kamleng awh vaiteh, vaiphu dawk rei ka kâhat han namaw, telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shuhi tami Bildad ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nâsittouh maw pout laipalah, lawk heh na tawng han, thaipanueknae tawn awh, hahoi lawk na dei pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang kecu dawk maw moithang patetlah touksin lah o awh teh, nangmae mithmu vah tamipathu patetlah ka kâpouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungkhueknae hoi namahoima na kâraphoe. Nang hanelah talai heh ceitakhai lah ao han maw, Hoeh pawiteh, lungsong heh aonae koehoi puen lah ao han maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e angnae teh roup padue pouh lah ao teh, a hmaiang hai ang hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rim e angnae hah a hmo teh, ateng e hmaiim teh padue e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khoksampha a thaonae hah duem sak la ao teh, amae khokhangnae ni a tâkhawng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A khok ni tamlawk dawk a kâman sak teh, karap thung vah a cei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A khoksampha dawk tamlawk a man teh, ama hah karap dawk a bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama hanelah karap hah talai dawk hro e la ao teh, lamthung dawk ama hane karap a patung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Avoivang hoi takikatho e ni a pakhi teh, a hnuk lahoi a pâlei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thaonae hah a thayoun toung dawkvah, atengpam vah rawkphainae coungkacoe lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hote runae ni a vuen hah a ca pouh teh, duenae camin ni a kutkhok hah a ca pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kângue e rim hoi ahni teh takhoe lah ao teh, takikatho pounge siangpahrang hmalah tâcokhai e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tami hoeh e hah rim dawk kho a sak awh teh, kho a saknae dawk gan a phuen pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A rahim e a tangpha hah koung a ke teh, a lathueng lae akangnaw teh a kamyai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama pahnim thai hoeh nahanlah talai dawk hoi a kahma teh, a min kamthangnaw e um vah a min awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahni teh angnae koehoi hmonae dawkvah a hrek teh, talai dawk hoi pâlei e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A taminaw thung dawk hoi a capa hoi a na mincanaw tawn hoeh. Hoeh pawiteh, a khosaknae dawkvah a imthung buet touh hai cawi mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahnie tueng nah kaawm e taminaw ni a taki awh e patetlah, ahni hnukkhu kaawm e naw ni hai ahni kecu a kângai a ru awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw khosaknae koe teh, hot patetlah ao han. Hetheteh Cathut ka panuek hoeh naw a onae hmuen doeh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Atueng nâsittouh maw ka hringnae he runae na poe awh teh, lawk hoi kai na raphoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vai hra totouh na pathoe awh e ka tak dawkvah na payon awh nakunghai na kayak awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka payon katang pawiteh, ka payonnae teh kai dawk pou ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kai na taranlahoi na kâoup awh teh, kai kayanae heh kai na tarannae lah na hno awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />kai dawkvah Cathut a payon tie hoi, a tamlawk hoi na ramuk tie hah panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Payonnae kong dawkvah ka hram pawiteh, na thai pouh mahoeh. Puenghoi ka hram nakunghai lannae hah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tapuet thai hoeh nahanlah ama ni ka lamthung hah a pâbing. Ka lamthung dawk hmonae hah a ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka bawilennae hah na rading pouh teh, ka lû dawk e bawilukhung hah na la pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Avoivang hoi vekvek na phi te ka kahma toe. Ka ngaihawinae teh, thingkung patetlah na phawk pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai na taranlahoi a lungkhueknae hah a kâan sak teh, a taran buet touh e patetlah na touksin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ransahu hah a kamkhueng awh teh, kai na taran lahoi lamthung a rasoun awh, ka lukkareirim tengpam petkâkalup lah na ven awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hmaunawnghanaw hah ahla nah koelah na puen pouh teh, ka panue e naw hah tamitavan lah koung ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka imthungnaw hai ka hmawt thai hoeh toe. Ka huikahawinaw ni koung na pahnim awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka im dawk kho kasaknaw, ka sannunaw ni imyin lah na pouk awh. Ahnimae mithmu vah imyin lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka sannaw hah ka kaw eiteh, na pato awh hoeh toe. Lawkkanem hoi pasawt a ngai toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hringnae teh ka yu hanelah a hnueai e lah ao teh, rei ka tâcawt e hmaunawnghanaw hanelah ngai ka tho e la awm hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Camoca ni patenghai na dudam awh. Ka thaw navah kai taranlahoi lawk a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka huiko kamyawng pueng ni na panuet awh. Ka lungpataw e naw ni hai kai tarankung lah koung ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka vuen hoi ka tak hai ka hru dawk rapkâbet. Kahâhli duengdoeh kaawm toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Oe, nangmouh ka huinaw, na pahren awh haw, na pahren awh haw, bangkongtetpawiteh Cathut e kut hoi na hem e la ka o toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bang kecu dawk maw Cathut na rektap e patetlah kai hah na rektap awh. Ka takthai dawk ka khangnae he na khout sak awh hoeh rah maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Oe, ka lawknaw he ca lah ka thun pawiteh, cauknaw dawk pakhum boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />thutnae sum hoi, talung dawk thut e a yungyoe hanelah awm pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />kai na karatangkung teh a hring tie hah ka panue. A hnuktengpoung nah talai van bout a kangdue han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka vuen heh raphoe hnukkhu hoi, ka takthai hoi Cathut hah ka hmu han tie hah ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kai kama roeroe ni ka hmu vaiteh, ayâ alouk ni a hmu dueng laipalah, kai ni kamae mit hoi roeroe ka hmu han. Banghloimaw ka thung e ka lungthin ni a rabui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hno coungnae a kung teh, kai dawkvah hmu awh eiteh, bangtelamaw, ahni teh rektap han, na tet awh boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Namamouh ni tahloi teh taket awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, lungkhueknae ni tahloi hoi reknae hah tâco sak. Lawkcengnae ao tie hah panuethai nahan telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Naamath tami Zophar ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ka pouk lawi, pathung nahane na poe, bangkongtetpawiteh, ka thung e lungreithai kecu dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tounnae ni na yue e hah ka thai toe. Ka muitha ni thaipanueknae hoi pathungnae na sak pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ayan hoi talaivan tami ao totouh hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tamikathoutnaw tânae tueng teh a duem. Cathut bang lah kangaihoehnaw e lunghawinae teh, dawngdengca doeh tie hah na panuek awh hoeh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kâoupnae hah kalvan totouh a pha teh, a lû ni tâmai hah ka phat nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A payungpaei patetlah a yungyoe kahmat vaiteh, ahni kahmawtnaw pueng ni na maw ao telah ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mang patetlah yout kahmat vaiteh, hmawt mahoeh toe. Karum e mang patetlah yout kahma e patetlah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahni kahmawt e mit ni vah hmawt mahoeh toe. Hoeh pawiteh, hmuen ni hai kuen mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A canaw ni tami ka roedeng minhmai kahawi hah tawng awh vaiteh, a kut hoi hnopai hah bout a bankhai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hrunaw teh nawcanae thaonae hoi akawi han. Hateiteh, vaiphu dawk a ikhai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pahni dawk kahawihoehe a radip. A lai rahim vah a hro nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasoung laipalah a pâkuem. A kâko dawkvah a hro nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A rawca teh, a vonthung vah a ui vaiteh, tahrunsue lah a kangcoung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tawnta e hnopai hah padoun vaiteh bout a palo han. Cathut ni a von thung hoi a tâkhawng pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tahrun sue hah a pahap teh, tahrun lai ni a ma a thei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kalawng e palang, khoitui hoi maito sanutui kamkak vaiteh, ka lawng e hmawt mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tawk e thaw ni a coung sak han ei, von paha nahanelah hno mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Karoenaw hah a ceitakhai hoi, a coungroe teh, Ama ni a sak hoeh e im hah a lawp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lung thung hoi roumnae hah a panue hoeh dawk. A ngai e hno buet touh boehai cawi mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ca hanelah a pek e banghai awm hoeh. Hatdawkvah a nawmnae ni kasaw awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nawm lahun nah kângairu vaiteh, ama taranlahoi kângairu patawpoung e kut dawk a pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A von a paha lahun nah Cathut ni a lungkhueknae hmai hah ahni koe a tha poeh han. A ca lahun nah a lathueng vah lungkhueknae kho a rak pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sum e senehmaica teh, a yawng takhai han ei, rahumpala ni pawkkayawng lah a ka awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pala teh a phawk, a tak dawk hoi a tâco pouh. Loukloukkaang e a hmo hah hmue thung hoi a tâco. Takikatho poung e a lathueng vah a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Runae pueng teh ama hanelah pâtung lah ao. Tami ni patawi hoeh e hmai ni be a kak vaiteh, a im dawk kaawm e pueng ama hoi a kak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kalvannaw ni a payonnae hah a pâpho han, talai ni ama hah a taran han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A im e hnopainaw hah be kahmat vaiteh, a lungkhueknae hnin dawk hnokahawinaw hah tui patetlah a lawng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hetheteh Cathut koehoi tamikathoutnaw ni a coe hanelah ao. Cathut ni a coe hane râw a pouk pouh e doeh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Job ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lawk he kahawicalah na thai pouh haw, Hetheh nangmouh lungmawng nahanelah awmseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka dei navah panguep awh ei, be ka dei hnukkhu hoi na panuikhai awh vai nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka phuenangnae heh tami tarannae lah maw ao. Hottelah awm pawiteh, bang kecu dawk maw, ka lung a saw thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na khen awh haw, kângairu awh naseh. Na pahni hah tabuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka pouk nah ka pâyaw takinae ni ka kâha a uek sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bang kecu dawk maw tamikathoutnaw ni a matawng totouh a hring awh teh, thaonae dawk bahu ao han vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ca catounnaw hah amamae mithmu vah a kung acaksak awh, amamae miphun hah amamae hmalah acaksak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A imnaw hah takinae thung hoi a hlout teh, Cathut e sonron hah ahnimae a lathueng bawt boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maitotan ni cati tu laipalah awm boihoeh. Maitomanu ni ca khe laipalah awm boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saringhu patetlah a canaw a tâco sak teh, a canaw teh a lam awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamawi hoi ratoung kueng laihoi la a sak awh, Tamawi e a lawk dawk hoi a lunghawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hringnawmnae hoi atueng aloum sak awh teh dongdengca dawk phuen vah a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hateiteh, Cathut koe na cettakhai yawkaw, na lamthung panue hane heh ka ngai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Athakasaipounge, a thaw ka tawk pouh hane teh apimaw, Ama koe ka ratoum navah ahawinae bangmaw ka mek telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tawn awh e hno hah amamae kut dawk kaawm e ka tang nahoeh, tami kathoutnaw khokhangnae teh, kaimouh koehoi kahlatpoung la ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e hmaiim teh, bangmaw atuhoitu a due teh, amamae rawkphainae teh, bangmaw atuhoitu a pha. Lungmathoenae hah Cathut ni a lungkhueknae dawk hoi lawk ouk a ceng boimaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kahlî dawk e cakong patetlah ao teh, kahlî ni palek e vaikong patetlah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cathut ni a canaw hanelah, payonpakai nahan a ta telah a ti. Panuethai awh nahanelah, ahnimouh teh ama ni patho naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ronae hah a mit hoi hmawt sak awh, Athakasaipounge lungkhueknae manang hah net sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a thapa akuep totouh atueng baw sak lah o teh, ama a rawk hnukkhu hoi a im teh, banglahai tho hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Karasang lah kaawm e hai lawkcengkung Cathut teh apinimaw panuenae a cangkhai thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lungmawngcalah hoi karoumcalah ao nah koe, tami buet touh a thao lahun nah a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A sanunaw hai sanutui abuem awh teh, a hrunaw hai rakhing hoi akawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami alouke buet touh, a nawmnae roeroe awm laipalah, lungmathoe nalaihoi a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vaiphu dawk reikâvan lah a i roi, tangraet ni muen a kayo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khenhaw! na pouknae naw hah ka panue. Ka lan hoeh poung e kai dawk sak han na noe e hah ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nâmaw bawi im teh a o, nâmaw tamikathoutnaw khosaknae rim teh ao telah na ti awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kahlawng ka cet e hah na pacei boihoeh na maw. Mitnoutnae naw hah na panuek awh hoeh maw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw teh, lawkcengnae hnin hanelah pouk tangcoung e lah ao awh. Lungkhueknae hnin nah tâcokhai lah ao awh han, tie hah na panuek hoeh maw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Apinimaw a hmaitung vah na lamthung hah hawihoeh atipouh han. Apinimaw a sak e hah a patho han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hateiteh, phuen koe ceikhai lah ao teh, phuen hah meng kountouk hanelah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ayawn dawk e kacoumnaw hah, ahnimouh hanlah, a radip vaiteh, tami pueng ni a kâbang han. A hmalah touklek hoeh e ka cet tangcoungnaw patetlah taminaw pueng a duksawn han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hottelah namamae pahni dawk laithoe pou ao lahun nah, bangtelamaw hrawnghrang lawk hoi lung khuet na pahawi thai awh han, telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Teman tami Eliphaz ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami teh Cathut hanelah a cungkeinae a tawn thai han namaw, A lungkaang e hai ama hanelah doeh cungkeinae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamikalan lah na onae hah, Athakasaipounge, a lungkahawi sak e lah ao han namaw Toun han awm laipalah na sak e na lamthung hah ahni hanelah a meknae ao han namaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama na taki kecu dawk maw na toun teh, lawkcengnae dawk na kâenkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hawihoehnae hah a len poung teh, pout laipalah na payonnae kecu dawk nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A khuekhaw awm laipalah na hmaunawngha e hno hah na man pouh teh, caici lah kaawm e hnicu hah na la pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tha ka tawn e koe, nei hane tui hah na poe hoeh teh, von kahlamnaw hanelah vaiyei hah na pasoung pouh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hateiteh, tami athakaawme ni ram a coe teh, a thung vah bari kaawm e tami ni kho a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lahmainu hah kut caici lah na ceisak awh teh, manu ka tawn hoeh e naranaw e kut hah na khoe pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah na tengpam e karap ni na kalup teh, puennae ni rucatnae na poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na hmu thai hoeh nahanelah, hmonae hoi tuikalen poung ni muen a khu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kalvan arasang nah koe, Cathut awm hoeh namaw Karasangpoung e âsinaw hah khenhaw! banghloimaw arasang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang ni, Cathut ni bangmaw a panue, Hmonae hloilah lawk a ceng thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hmu thai hoeh nahanelah, katha poung e tâmai ni a ramuk teh, kalvan lathueng lah a kâhlai, telah na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw ni karawk e lam karuem dawk meng na cei han namaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Apimaw atueng kuep hoehnahlan vah la e lah kaawm niteh, apini a ung e maw tuikalen ni a la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cathut koe, na cettakhai yawkaw, Athakasaipounge ni ahnimouh hanelah bangmaw a sak thai telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hateiteh a imnaw hah hnokahawi hoi akawi sak. Hateiteh tamikathout e khokhangnae teh, kai koehoi kahlatpoung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamikalan ni a hmu teh, a lunghawi. Yonnae ka tawn hoeh e ni dudamkungnaw hah a panuikhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka tarannaw teh, raphoe katang lah ao teh, kacawie naw hah hmai ni a kak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama koe kâpanuek sak nateh, karoumcalah awm, haw hoi nang hanelah hnokahawi a tâco han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pahren lahoi amae kâko hoi ka tâcawt e hringnae na cangkhai e hah dâw haw. Na lungthin thungvah amae lawk hah kahawicalah kuem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Athakasaipounge, koevah na ban pawiteh, kangdout thai e lah o han. Na payonpakai e hah na im dawk hoi kahlatpoung lah na takhoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nange sui teh, vaiphu dawk na ta han. Ophir sui hah sawkca thung e, sadinaw patetlah na pâtung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Athakasaipounge teh, nange sui hoi aphu kaawm e ngun lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hottelah Athakasaipounge dawkvah na lunghawi han. Cathut koe lah na khet han toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama koe na ratoum vaiteh, na thai pouh han. Na lawkkam hah na kuep sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hno buet touh na kâcai vaiteh, nama hanelah caksak lah ao han. Hot patetvanlah na lamthung dawk angnae ni a tue han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na tâkhawng navah tawmrasang e lah na o han telah na ti han. Hottelah kârahnoum e hah ama ni a rungngang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka yon hoeh e hah a rungngang han. Na kut thoungnae hoi rungngang lah ao han, telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Job ni a pathung teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sahnin hai ka phuenangnae a patawpoung. Ka kâhram lawi vah ka kut ni thayung awm hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Oe, ama teh nâ lah maw ao tie hah ka panue vaiteh, a tahungnae koe ka phat haw pawiteh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hmalah ka kong heh ka phakhai vaiteh, ka pahni teh na lawkpanuesaknae hoi a kawi han ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na pathungnae lawk hah ka panue vaiteh, kai koe a dei hane hah ka thaipanuek han ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lentoe e hnotithainae hoi na taran han namaw Na taran mahoeh, ka kong hah hoe na pouk pouh han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hawvah ama hoi tamikalan ni pouk thai awh vaiteh, lawkcengkungnaw koehoi yungyoe ka hlout han toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khenhaw! hmalah ka cei, hateiteh ama la awm hoeh. Hnuklah bout ka ban eiteh, ama teh ka hmawt thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Avoilae kut hoi a tawk navah ama teh ka khen thai hoeh. Aranglae kut dawk a kamlang toteh ama hah ka hmawt thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hateiteh, ka dawn e lamthung hah ama ni a panue. Na tanouk toteh sui patetlah ka tâco han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A khok dawk ka khok ni kacakcalah a kamtung teh, a lamthung hah phen laipalah ka dawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pahni dawk hoi kâpoelawk hah ka cettakhai hoeh. A pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e lawk hah ka panki e rawca hlak hai ka pâtung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hateiteh, ama teh buet touh lah ao dawkvah, apinimaw a dum thai han. A hringnae ni a sak han a ngai e pueng hah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kai hanelah a pouk e hah a sak. Ama dawk hot patet e hah moikapap ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a hmalah o e hah ka taki. Hetheh ka pouk navah ama ka taki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cathut ni ka lung a pout sak teh, Athakasaipounge hah na taki sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatei, hmonae dawk hoi na kapek hoeh teh, ka hma lae hmonae kadung poung e dawk na ramuk hoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangkong maw atuengnaw heh Athakasaipounge ni a hro hoeh vaw, ama kapanueknaw ni amamae ahnin hah a hmu thai awh hoeh vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tangawn ni khori hah a puen awh. Saringnaw hah a lawp awh teh ama hanelah a paca awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naranaw e la hah a pâlei pouh awh teh, lahmai e maitotan hah lawkkamnae lah a pangen pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami kavoutthoupnaw hah lamthung a phen sak awh. Ram thung e karoedengnaw hah pâkhueng teh, kâhro hoi ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thingyeiyawn ramke dawk e la patetlah, rawca tawng hanelah, thaw tawk han lah a cei awh. Amamouh hoi a canaw hanelah ram ni ca hane rawca a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Law dawk e saringnaw e rawca hah a pâkhueng teh, tamikathoutnaw e misurpaw hah a pâtung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khohna e awm laipalah karum khodai caici lah a i awh. Pâding nah kâkhu hane tawn awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mon dawk kho ka rak e ni cupkâkasu lah a pâsin teh, a phui nahanelah lungsongpui a kângue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A na pa kaawm hoeh e camo teh, a manu e sanu hoi a pâphei sak. Karoedengnaw hah amamae hno hah a pâhung sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Karoedengnaw, hah caici lah ao sak awh. A von kahlamnaw koe e cabong hah a la pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ayânaw im vah satui hah a kuen awh teh, misurpaw katin nalaihoi tui a kahran awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khopui thung vah hmenghmeng a due awh teh, a hramki awh. Hmâ a ca awh teh, hringnae hah a kaw awh. Hateiteh, Cathut ni a ratoum awh e hah pato hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Angnae hah taranlahoi tarankathawnaw hah ao. A lamthung hah panuek awh hoeh teh, angnae lamthung hah ngai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamikathetnaw ni angnae dawk hoi a thaw awh teh, karoedengnaw hoi kavoutthoupnaw hah a thei awh. Karum e tami tamru patetlah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ayâ yu yonkhai hane mit ni khohmo a ngaihawi. Minhmai a hro teh, apini na hmawt mahoeh telah a pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kanîthun lah mitnout a ta e im hah karum lah a muk awh teh, angnae hah panuek awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh hanelah teh, amom hah duenae tâhlip patetlah ao. Tami ni panuek awh boipawiteh, takikatho poung e duenae tâhlip doeh ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tui hoi karanglah pâyo sak lah ao awh han. Talai dawkvah coe hane thoebo lah ao han. Hatdawkvah, apihai misur takha lamthung koe lah kamlang mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kawmpoi khumbei kâan e ni tadamtui a kamyawt sak. Hot patetvanlah, phuen ni yonnae ka sak e hah a payawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Camo im ni a pahnim awh vaiteh, tangraet ni katuipoung lah a ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, cakaroe e hah a rektap teh, lahmainu hanelah hnokahawi lah awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hateiteh, Cathut ni athaonae hoi, tami athakaawme taminaw e lamthung hah a raphoe pouh. Hring hane kamcenglah a panue hoeh nakunghai, Ama ni a thaw sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kângue hane a poe teh, hawvah a kâhat sak. A mit teh ahnimae lamthung dawk ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vai touh hoi tawm lah ao teh, hat hnukkhu hoi a kahma awh. Rahnoum sak la ao teh, ayânaw patetvanlah a kâhmo van han. Cavui patetlah a ke awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hot patetlah awm hoeh pawiteh, apini maw na laithoe a tithai han. Ka dei e heh bang hoeh e lah ka coung sak thai e na o awh maw telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Shuhi tami Bildad ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uknae hoi takinae teh amae naw doeh. Hmuenrasang dawkvah roumnae naw a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ransanaw hah apinimaw a touk thai han. Apie lathueng maw na angnae hah tâcawt laipalah ao boi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangtelamaw Cathut e hmalah tami a lan thai han. Hoeh pawiteh, bangtelamaw napui ni khe e hah a thoung thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thapa patenghai ang laipalah, âsinaw hai amae mithmu vah thoung awh hoeh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pâri hoi tangraet rumram lah kaawm e taminaw natawng teh bangtelamaw hoe thoung thai han vaw, telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatei Job ni a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnotithainae ka tawn hoeh e teh, bangtelamaw na kabawp, thaonae ka tawn hoeh e kut teh, bangtelamaw na rungngang thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungangnae ka tawn hoeh e teh, bangtelamaw na toun thai, tami moikapap koevah kalan e pouknae hah bangtelamaw na poe thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Api koe maw lawk teh na pâpho pouh. Apie muitha maw nama koe ka phat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami kadout hah a pâyaw teh, tui rahim vah ao teh, haw vah kaawm e naw hoi a pâyaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hmalah duenae caici lah ao. Rawkphainae ni ramuknae tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kalvan teh ahrawnghrang dawk a kangdue. Talai hai ahrawnghrang dawk a kâbang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Katha poung e tâmai dawk tui hah mek a racut teh, a rahim e tâmai hah kâbawng awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A bawitungkhung e hmalah a ramuk teh, a lathueng vah tâmai a tabo sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Angnae hoi hmonae langri a ta nahanelah tui dawk a langri a ruen pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kalvan toenae khom a kâhuet teh, a tounnae hah kângai lah a ru.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnotithainae lahoi tuipui a thaw sak. Bahu lahoi tûilî hah thawk a kapek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A muitha lahoi kalvan a pathoup sak. Kamleng e khorui hai a kut hoi a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khenhaw! hetnaw heh lamthung nueng kamtawngnae doeh. Ahnimouh koe e thai awh e hrolawk teh, banghloimaw a thoung. Hateiteh, keitat hnotithainae hah, apinimaw a panue thai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job ni a dei e hah bout a patawp teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cathut ni ka lannae, na la pouh teh, Athakasaipounge, ka hringnae ka pataw sak e teh a hring e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thung e a thakaawm sak e Cathut e kâha teh ka hnong dawk ao thung pueng teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pahni ni kathoute lawk dei mahoeh. Ka lai ni dumnae tâcawtsak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lan awh tie hah ka dei hane savisava doeh. Ka due totouh ka lannae heh khoeroe ka pahnawt mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lannae heh kacakcalah ka kuet teh, kahmat sak mahoeh. Ka hring thung pueng ka lungthin ni kama yon na pen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka taran hah tamikathout patetlah awm awh naseh. Kai na taranlahoi ka kangdout e hah tami kalan hoeh lah awm awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami kahawihoehe naw ngaihawinae teh, banghai nahoeh. Moi ka tawn nakunghai Cathut ni a hringnae lat pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a lathueng vah runae a pha torei teh, a cingounae hah Cathut ni a thai pouh han maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Athakasaipounge, lah amahoima a lunghawi han namaw, Cathut hah pou a kaw han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cathut e kut hoi a sak e hah na dei pouh vai. Athakasaipounge, koevah kaawm e hah ka hrawk mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hot teh abuemlah ni na hmu katang awh. Hottelah pawiteh, bangkongmaw bang hoeh e dawk pou na panui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hetteh, Cathut koehoi tamikathoutnaw coe hanelah ao. Tami kahnephnapnaw e a coe e raw. Athakasaipounge, koehoi a hmu awh e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a catounnaw a kamphung nakunghai tahloi hanelah doeh ao. A canaw ni vonhlam hoi kho a sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaawm rae naw teh, duenae dawk pakawp la ao awh han. Lahmainaw ni khuikapkhai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaiphu patetlah ngunnaw ka pâtung nakunghai, tangdong patetlah hnopai ka pâtung nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a pâtung thai han. Hateiteh, tamikalan ni a khohna han, kayonhoehnaw ni ahnie ngun hah a kârei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bomba patetlah im a sak teh, ramveng ni rim a sak e patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tami ka tawn poung ni a due torei teh, pakawp e lah awm mahoeh. A mit a padai nah teh koung a kahma toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Takithopoung e ni ahni teh tuikalen patetlah a la. Karum lah tûilî ni a kahma sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kanîtholah kahlî ni a palek teh awmhoeh toe. A onae hmuen koehoi a palek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pek e awm laipalah ama khuehoi a palek. A thasainae thung hoi koung a kahma han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Taminaw ni a kuttabawng sin han. Terawseh tet awh vaiteh aonae koehoi a pâlei awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngun tainae tangkom ao katang, sui sôlêinae a hmuen hai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sum teh talai dawk hoi la e lah a o, rahum teh talung dawk hoi thawng e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami ni hnonae dawk a pout sak teh, a hmuen kingkadi e pueng totouh a tawng awh, duenae tâhlip hoi hmonae thung vah a cei awh teh a tawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami a ohoehnae koe vah tangkom a tai teh, khok ni a pahnim e hmuennaw hah tami hoi a kâhlanae hmuen koe a bang awh teh, pou a kâhuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Talai e tui dawk hoi rawca tâconae lah a o, a rahim lah teh hmai ni talai a kâthungsak e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hote talungnaw teh, sapphire talung a phukaawm a tâconae a kung lah ao. Sui kanuinaw hai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hote lamthung teh tavanaw ni panuek hoeh, mataw e mit ni hai hmawt hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka po e sendek ni hai coungroe hoeh, ka matheng e sendek hai cet boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Talung dawk tami ni kut a toung teh, mon hah a kung koehoi pakhuppathan lah dek a palei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungsongpui hah a kavi teh, ravohong a sak teh, a mit hoi a phukaawm poung e hno hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui ka phuek e hah a tawng teh, kâhrawk e hnonaw hah angnae dawk a tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hateiteh, nâ lah maw lungangnae hmuthainae teh, nâ lah maw panuethainae hmuen hah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aphu onae tami ni panuek hoeh, Tami onae ram dawk hmu thai lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kadunge ni kai koe awm hoeh telah a ti, talî ni kai koe awm hoeh a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sui hoi ran thai lah awm hoeh, aphu teh ngun hoi hai bangnue thai lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ophir talung phu kaawm ni hai phat thai hoeh, aphu kaawm poung e onyx hoi sapphire ni hai phat thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sui hoi talung phukaawm ni hai phat thai hoeh, sui kathoung hoi hai thung thai lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koral hoi jasper hai deipan han kamcu hoeh, Bangkongtetpawiteh, lungangnae phu teh, Rubies talung hlak hai a phu hoe a rasang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ethiopia ram e topaz talung phu kaawm ni phat thai hoeh, sui kathoung ni hai aphu onae phat thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hot patet lae lungangnae teh, nâhoi maw a tho, thoumthainae hmuen teh nâ lah maw ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kahringnaw pueng e mit ni a khet teh hmawt thai hoeh, kalvan e tavanaw ni hai a tawng teh hmawt thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rawkphainae hoi duenae ni a dei awh e kamthang hah, ka hnâ ni a thai telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cathut ni a lamthung hah a panue pouh teh, hmuen hai a panue
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ama ni talai apout totouh a khet, kalvan rahim pueng hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kahlî teh khing hane hoi, tui teh bangnuenae hoi bangnue hane,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />kho a rak nahanelah lamthung a sak pouh teh, khoparitnae hoi sumpapalik nahane lamthung a sak pouh navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lungangnae a hmu teh a pâpho, a caksak teh a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami koe khenhaw! BAWIPA takinae teh lungangnae doeh, kahawihoehe ceitakhai e teh panuethainae doeh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job ni a dei lawk hah bout a patawp teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Oe ka loum tangcoung e a kum hoi thapa naw dawk bout kaawm haw pawiteh, Cathut ni na kountouknae a hnin patetlah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka lû dawk hmaiim a ang teh, a angnae dawk hoi hmonae ka tapuet thai navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka roung takhangnae a tueng, ka im dawk Cathut hoi kâhuikonae tueng, hatnae patetlah bout kaawm haw pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Athakasaipounge, kai koe na okhai e hoi, ka canaw ka teng vah petkâkalup lah ao awh navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ceinae lamthung dawk maito sanutui a lawng, lungsongpui ni kai hanelah satui pou a lawng sak navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />khopui kâennae longkha koe ouk ka cei navah, thongma dawk ouk ka tahungnae koe ka ceikhai navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thoundounnaw ni na hmu awh teh, a kâhro awh. Kacuenaw ni a thaw awh teh a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawinaw ni lawk dei hane pahni a cakuep awh. A kut hoi pahni a tabuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawinaw hai lawkkamuem lah duem ao awh teh, a lai teh adangka dawk rapkâbet pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hnâ ni a thai torei teh, yawhawi na poe awh. A mit hoi a hmu awh torei teh na panuikhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, karoedengnaw hah ka rungngang teh na pa hoi kabawmkung ka tawn hoeh e naw hah ouk ka kabawp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kahmatkatanaw e yawhawinaw hah, ka lathueng vah a pha. Lahmainaw e lungthin hah lunghawinae la ka sak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lannae hah ka khohna teh, ka lannae teh angkidung hoi bawilakhung patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mitdawnnaw hanelah mit lah ka o teh, khokkhemnaw hanelah khok lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Karoedengnaw, hanelah na pa lah ka o teh, ka panue hoeh e naw e lawk hai ka ngai pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e a no hah ka khoe pouh teh, a hâ hoi a kei e hah ka rasa pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hottelah ka tabu thung ka due vaiteh, ka hninnaw teh sadi patetlah ka pung sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui aonae koe vah ka tangphanaw ka payang vaiteh, ka kangnaw dawk karum khodai tadamtui ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka bawilennae teh ka thung vah bout a katha teh, ka pala teh ka kut dawk a tha hoi a kawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Taminaw ni na ring teh na rabui awh. Ka khokhangnae dawk duem ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka dei hnukkhu hoi banghai dei awh hoeh toe. Ka dei e teh ahnimouh koe tadamtui patetlah a bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khotui patetlah na ring awh teh, a hnukteng e kho ka rak e patetlah kakawpoung lah pahni a ang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka panuikhai pawiteh yuem awh mahoeh. Ka minhmai a angnae teh, hmonae lah awm sak awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahnimouh hane lamthung ka rawi teh, kahrawikung patetlah ka tahung. Hottelah ransanaw thung vah siangpahrang patetlah kho ka sak. A lung ka mathoutnaw lungpahawi e patetlah ka o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatei, atuteh kai hlak ka camo e naw ni Kai na pathoe awh. A napanaw hah kai ni ka panuet teh, kaie tuhu ka ring e uinaw koe patenghai bawk van hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thaonae hah kai hanelah bangmaw cungkeinae kaawm. A thayung tawn awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Takangnae hoi voutthoup dawk a kamsoe awh teh, kahrawngum kingdinae hmuen koe tang a yawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pho um e angmai hna a la awh teh, samphokung e a tangpha hah rawca hanelah a tai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh, tami koehoi pâlei awh teh, tamru patetlah a hramsin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tangkom thung hoi lungngoum thung o hanelah doeh ao awh. Talai hoi talung kâko dawk ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Caprapum vah a hram awh teh, pâkhingum vah a tabo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh tamipathu e canaw doeh. Bang pato patang hoeh e canaw doeh. Ram thung hoi hrek e naw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atu teh la lah na sak awh hanelah ka o toe. Na pathoe e lah ka o toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na panuet awh teh kai hoi kâhlat lah na o awh. Ka minhmai na tamthawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, lirui hah a rasu awh teh, na ka pacekpahlek awh. Ka hmalah kammoumrui a rasu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kaie aranglah nawsainaw a kangdue teh, ka khok hah a phen awh. A rawkphainae lamthung hah kai taranlahoi a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka lamthung hah a raphoe awh. Kai ka tâlaw nahanelah a kâyawm awh. Ahnimouh kâhruetcuet ka poe hane apihai awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka kaw poung e kâko dawk hoi a tho awh teh, ningkatim rahim vah na kalup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Takithopoung e ka lathueng vah a pha. Bari lah ka onae hah kahlî patetlah a pâlei awh. Ka tawn e naw hah tâmai patetlah a kahma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kângairunae ni ka hringnae teh a rabawk toe. Ka khangnae hninnaw ni khak na kuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Karum lah ka hru hah koung a thut teh, ka tharui patawnae ni roum thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka patawpoung e ni hnicu hoi kayo e patetlah na kayo teh, angki lahuen patetlah na katek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tangdong dawk na tâkhawng teh, hraba hoi vaiphu patetlah ka o toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nama koe ka hram, hateiteh, na pato hoeh. Ka kangdue teh na khet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatei, kai hanelah ka pahngawpahrak e lah na o. Na kut thasainae ni na taran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kahlî dawk na tawm teh, a lathueng vah na kâcui sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nama ni duenae dawk na ceikhai hane hah ka panue. Hringnae katawnnaw pueng hanelah, na pouk pouh tangcoung e im dawkvah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a kut a dâw torei teh, a kâhei nakunghai, banglah tho hoeh toe. A raphoe torei teh, a hram nakunghai hawinae awm hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Runae ka kâhmonaw hanlah ouk ka ka nahoehmaw. Karoedengnaw hanlah lungreithai hoi kaawm boihoeh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hateiteh, hawinae ka tawng navah, hno kahawihoehe hah ka lathueng vah a pha. Angnae ka ring navah hmonae a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka lungthin a tâsue teh roum thai hoeh. Ka khangnae hninnaw ni na tho sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Panuinae koelah tho hoeh niteh, lungmathoe koelah ka cei. Kamkhuengnaw rahak vah, ka kangdue teh, kabawpnae ka hei teh ka hram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kahrawnguinaw e hmaunawngha lah ka o. Kalauk tavanaw hoi huiko lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka vuen teh hoehoe a tamang teh kai koehoi a bo, Ka hrunaw teh puenghoi a kâan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka ratoung teh ka lungmathoenae lah a coung, ka tamawi teh kâlawk lah a coung.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mit ni lawkkamnae a sak, Bang kecu dawk maw tangla hah ka mit ni a khet han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, lathueng lae Cathut koehoi ka coe hane hoi, Athakasaipounge koehoi a parâw e teh bangmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw raphoe teh, payonpakainae ka sak e naw rawkphainae nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama ni ka lamthung hah a hmu teh, ka khokhnuk pueng hai be a touk nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kalan hoeh e lah ka hring pawiteh, hoeh pawiteh, dumyennae hoi ka khok a hue rang pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kânging e yawcu khingnae hoi na khing haw, Cathut ni ka lannae hah a panue thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pahni ni lamthung phen boipawiteh, ka mit hoi ka hmu e patetlah lungthin ka tawn pawiteh, ka kut dawk ka tamang e kâbet pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cati na tu sak haw, ayâ louk ni cat naseh, ka a hane be phawng naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Napui ni ka lungthin na pasawt payon pawiteh, ka imri e takhang arulahoi ka tuet pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka yu ni ayâ hane cakang phawm naseh. Ayâ ni ipkhai naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, hot teh kathoute lah awm vaiteh, lawkcengnae koe tâcokhai hanelah kamcu e payonnae lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, raphoe hanelah hmai ni a kak e lah ao han, Ka tawn e abuemlah be kahmat e lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka sannu sanpanaw ni kai koe a phuenang awh navah, noutna laipalah kaawm pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />BAWIPA a thaw torei teh, kai ni bangmaw ka sak han. Na toun navah bangtelamaw ka pato han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Von thung vah kai ka sak e ni, ahnimouh hai sak hoehnamaw, ama ni manu e von thung rei na sak hoehnamaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Karoedengnaw, e a ngainae hah poe laipalah kaawm pawiteh, lahmainaw lung ka pout sak pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />naranaw hah canei hane rei laipalah, kama dueng ouk ka cat pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hateiteh, ahni hah ka nawca hoi a na pa patetlah ka okhai, anu e von thung hoi lahmai patetlah ka khetyawt toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tami bangpatet hai hnicu laipalah kadout e hoi, tami karoedengnaw kâkhu han ka tawn hoeh e ka hmawt boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lungthin hoi kai yawhawi na poe hoeh teh, ka tumuen hoi phu ka bet sak hoehpawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />longkha koe e kabawpnae ka hmu torei teh, naranaw taranlahoi ka kut ka dâw pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ka kut heh ka loung dawk hoi kârakhing naseh, ka lounghrunaw hah kâkhoe naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut koehoi rawkphainae teh, kai hanelah taki a tho poung, bangkongtetpawiteh, a lentoenae teh ka khang thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sui hah ngaihawinae hoi ka sak teh, nang teh ka lungmawngnae doeh, telah suikathoung koe ka dei boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ka kut hoi ka tawk e ni moikapap a hmu teh, ka tawntanae a len poung dawkvah, lunghawinae ka tawn boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />kanî a sei torei ka pouk teh, a angnae hoi ka cet e thapa hah a lawkpui lah ka pouk teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />hottelah ka lungthin hah arulahoi a pasawt teh, ka pahni ni ka kut pahnuem pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />het haiyah lawkcengnae hmuen koe phakhai han kamcu e payonnae doeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, lathueng la kaawm e Cathut hah pahnawt e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka hmuhma e lathueng vah, rawkphainae a pha navah, ka lunghawi teh, a lathueng vah kathout e ka hmu navah, kai kâoup pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka pahni ni yonnae dawk thoseh, a hringnae hah thoebo hane kâpoe hanelah ka pasoung hoeh e thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lukkareiim dawk taminaw ni a teng vah kaawm e apimaw von ka hlam e kaawm boi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hateiteh, imyin ni lam vah roe boi hoeh, Bangkongtetpawiteh, kahlawng ka cet naw hanelah ka im vah tho ouk ka paawng pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Adam patetlah kâtapoenae hah ka ramuk teh, ka payonpakainae hah ka lungtabue thung ka hrawk pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tamimaya a pap poung dawkvah, ka taki teh ka imthungnaw dudamnae ka taki kecu dawkvah, duem ka o e hoi alawilah tâco thai hoeh e lah kaawm pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Oe, kapanuekkhaikung buet tabang awm haw pawiteh, khenhaw! hetteh kaie kutnout doeh, Athakasaipounge ni, na pato haw pawiteh, kai na katarannaw ni cauk dawk thut haw pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka loung dawk hoi roeroe ka sin vaiteh, bawilukhung patetlah ka kâmuk han ei .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka khokhnuknaw pueng hai ama koe ka pâpho han, bawi patetlah ama teh ka hnai han ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka ram ni kai taranlahoi a hram teh, laikawk kongnaw ni cungtalah khui awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />aphu poe laipalah a pawnaw hah ka ca teh, katawnkungnaw hringnae sung sak e lah kaawm boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />hottelah cang yueng lah pâkhing paw naseh, Catun yueng lah phovainaw paw naseh telah a ti, Job e lawk a pâpout toe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job ni amahoima tamikalan a kâti dawkvah, tami kathum touh ni Job pathung awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hottelah Barakel e capa Elihu, Buz tami Ram catoun Elihu teh pueng hoi a lungkhuek. Cathut hlak amahoima tamikalan a kâti dawkvah, Job koe a lungkhuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Job e a hui kathum touh koehai a lungkhuek. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Job hah na payon atipouh eiteh, bout pathung nahane panuek awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh, ama hlak vah kacuehnawn lah ao. Elihu ni Job koevah lawk dei hanelah meng a ring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Elihu ni hetnaw kathum touh e pahni dawk hoi pathung nahan awm hoeh tie hah a panue torei teh, a lung puenghoi a khuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hottelah, Barakel e capa Elihu, Buz tami ni hettelah a pathung. Kai teh kum kanaw teh, nangmouh teh na kumcue poung awh toe. Hatdawkvah, na taki awh teh, ka pouknae hai ka dei ngam hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum ni dei naseh, kum moikapap ni lungangnae cangkhai naseh ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hateiteh, tami e thung kaawm e muitha, Athakasaipounge kâha hah panuethainae kapoekung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamikalannaw ni hoe lungangnae awm hoeh kum kacuenaw ni lannae hoe panuethainae awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, na thai pouh awh haw, kai ni hai ka pouknae ka pâpho han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khenhaw! na lawknaw hah ka thai teh, dei hanelah ao telah na pouk lahun nah na panuesaknae hah ka panue toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kahawicalah na thai pouh haw lawk ka pathung thai e Job e a lung pan ka cai sak e, nangmouh thung dawk buet touh hai na awm awh hoeh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungangnae ka hmu toe, tami nahoeh niteh, Cathut ni ama teh a tâ han na tet awh payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lawknaw ni rep na tâdue hoeh nangmae lawk patetlah ahni teh bout ka pathung mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lung a pout awh teh, pathung awh hoeh toe, lawkkamuem ao awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lawk a dei awh hoeh toung dawkvah, ka ring rah, bangkongtetpawiteh, pathung toung laipalah duem a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kai ni hai kama hane ka pathung van han, ka pouknae teh ka pâpho van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, lawk hoi ka kawi teh, ka thung e muitha ni dei hoeh laipalah, na awm sak thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thung lae hah misurtui tâconae kâko kaawm hoeh e patetlah ao. Misurtui um katha patetlah kâbawng hane coungkacoe ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka kâha a tâco thai nahanelah, lawk ka dei han, Ka pahni roeroe ka ang vaiteh ka pathung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Apipi nakunghai, kapeknae kamnue sak hoeh nahanlah tami bangpatet hai ka oup hoeh nahanlah ka ratoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami oupnae hah ka thoum hoeh, telah nahoeh pawiteh, kasakkung ni palang na lat payon vaih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hateiteh Job, pahren lahoi ka dei e heh na thai pouh haw, ka lawk ka dei e heh na ngai pouh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Atu ka pahni ka ang teh, ka pahni dawk hoi ka lai ni lawk a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lawknaw heh kalan e ka lungthung hoi a tâco teh, ka pahni ni kathounge panuenae a pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cathut e Muitha ni na sak teh, Athakasaipounge kâha ni hringnae na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na pathung thai pawiteh na pathung haw, ka hmalah na lawk hah bout kâpouk haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Atangcalah tetpawiteh, kai teh Cathut hmalah lawk ka dei pouh e lah ka o, kai hai vaiphu hoi sak e lah ka o van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kai dawk kaawm hoeh e takinae ni na takisak roeroe han, nahoeh pawiteh, ka kut heh na tak dawk ri poung mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hnâthainae dawk na dei toung dawkvah, na lawk teh ka thai toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lawk ka ek hoeh dawkvah ka thoung, Yonnae ka tawn hoeh, payonpakainae kai dawk awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatei, kai taran nahane atueng kahawi a hmu teh, a taran patetlah na pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka khok hah hlong na buet teh, ka lamthung pueng hah a khet na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khenhaw! hivah nang teh na lan hoeh, na pathung han, bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut teh tami hlak a len.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama ni a lawk bangpatethai noutna mahoeh telah, bangkongmaw ama hah na pathoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut ni lam alouklah hoi lawk a dei thai, hatei, tami ni hmawt panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Karum a i navah vision dawk mat ka ip e, ikhun dawk a i lahun nah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami e hnâkâko hah a ang sak teh, amae cangkhainae hah a cak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sak e thung dawk hoi tami a ban teh, a kâoupnae dawk hoi hro lah ao thai nahanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a hringnae hah tangkom thung hoi a kountouk teh, tahloi hoi duenae thung hoi a hringnae a rungngang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tami teh a ikhun dawk patawnae hoi a yue teh, a hrunaw hah puenghoi patawnae hoi a pataw sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hottelah a hringnae ni rawca a panuet teh, katuipounge rawca hai a hringnae ni a panuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A takthai a kamsoe teh, kamnuek boihoeh e a hrunaw hah a kamnue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hringnae ni tangkom hah a hnai teh, a hringnae ni kathetkung hah hoehoe a hnai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahni hanelah laiceinaw awm boipawiteh, kâponae kasakkung 1000 thung dawk tami buet tabang awm pawiteh, tami ni amae lannae hah a hmu sak thai nahanelah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama ni tami hah a pahren teh, tangkom thung bonae koehoi ama teh a rungngang han, ratangnae buet touh ka hmu toe telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A takthai teh camo e takthai patetlah bout ao vaiteh, a nawcanae patetlah bout ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cathut koevah a ratoum vaiteh, ama teh a lathueng vah a lunghawi han, a minhmai hah lunghawi hoi a hmu han, bangkongtetpawiteh, ama ni tami teh a lannae hoi bout a ban sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A huikonaw a khet teh ka yon toe, tamikalan hah ka rawp sak toe, hot teh kai hanelah banghai cungkeinae awmhoeh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tangkom thung e a hringnae hah a ratang vaiteh, a hringnae ni angnae a hmu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khenhaw! Cathut ni hete hnopueng heh, vai hni, atangcalah vai thum totouh tami koe a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hringnae angnae ni a ma hah a tue thai nahanelah, a hringnae tangkom thung hoi a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na hnâpakeng nateh, Job na thai pouh haw, duem awm haw ka dei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Dei hanelah na tawn pawiteh, na pathung haw, dei haw, bangkongtetpawiteh, yon ngaithoum hane na ngaikhai poung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Telah nahoeh pawiteh, na thai pouh haw, duem awm haw, lungangnae na dei pouh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu ni rekrek a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmouh a lungkaangnaw ka lawk heh thai awh, Nangmouh panuenae katawnnaw, na hnâpakeng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka kâko ni rawca atuinae a patek e patetlah, hnâ ni lawk hah a tanouk van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maimouh roeroe ni lannae teh, kârawi awh haw sei. Ahawinae hah bangmaw tie hah maimae thung hoi panuek awh haw sei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Job ni kai teh ka lan, hateiteh, Cathut ni ka lannae a la
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lannae e kong dawk ka laithoe han na maw, kâtapoenae ka tawn hoeh nakunghai ka hmâ teh, ka dam thai hoeh e doeh toe, telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Panuikhainae hah tui patetlah ka net e, Job patetlah apimaw kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Payonnae kasaknaw hoi kamyawng e, tamikathoutnaw hoi ka cet e apimaw kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut koe lunghawi e heh, tami ni banghai hawinae awm hoeh telah ati toe
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, panuethainae katawnnaw na thai pouh haw, kathoute ka sak e teh, Cathut hanelah roeroe coung thai hoeh, yonnae ka sak e teh, Athakasaipounge hanelah khoeroe coung thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami hah a sak e patetlah ama ni a patho han, tami pueng a tawksak e hoi kamcu lah tawkphu kamcu lah a poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cathut ni kahawihoeh poung lah sak mahoeh, nahoeh pawiteh, Athakasaipounge ni lannae teh, khoeroe kamlang takhai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Apinimaw ama teh talai e thaw a poe, talai van pueng heh apinimaw ama a uk sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ni tami teh a ngainae awm hoeh pawiteh, kai e hringnae kâha hah lat boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Takthai pueng reirei a kahma han tami teh vaiphu lah bout a ban han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thaipanueknae na tawn awh pawiteh, Kâlawk pawlawk heh thai awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lannae ka hmuhma e ni a uk han namaw, Kalan ni teh athakaawme hah, yon na pen thai namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang teh banghai cungkeinae na awm hoeh telah, siangpahrang koe dei pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hateiteh, ahni ni bawi hai kapeknae tawn hoeh, Tami tangreng hoi roedeng hoi kapeknae ka tawn hoeh e doeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, abuemlahoi amae kutsaknaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Karumsaning tawkkadek a due awh teh, taminaw pueng hah a kâhuet awh teh, koung a kahma awh, tami athakaawme hai tami e kut laipalah be kahmat lah a la pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a mit teh tami e lamthung dawk ao teh, a khoktakan puenghai be a hmu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yonnae kasaknaw, amamouh kâhro nahane hmuen awmhoeh, duenae tâhlip hai awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut e hmalah lawkceng hane cei hanelah, tami e kong bout pouk hane ama ni panki hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kung rek khei ngai laipalah athakaawme taminaw hah koung a tâtueng han, ahnimae hmuen dawk tami alouke o nahanelah ka poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ahnimouh ni a sak e pueng hah a panue teh, karum vah ama ni a tâkhawng teh koung a kâbawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tami ni a hmu thai e hmuen koe, tamikathoutnaw patetlah a hem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ama hah a kamlang takhai awh, a lamthung hah pouk raw pouk awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hottelah karoedengnaw e lawk hah a hmalah a pha, Bangkongtetpawiteh rektapnaw e lawk hah a ma ni a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />BAWIPA ni roumnae a poe torei teh, apinimaw rucatnae a poe thai han, a minhmai a hro torei teh, apinimaw a hmu thai han, miphun buet touh taranlahoi thoseh, tami buet touh taranlahoi thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tamikahawihoeh e ni a uk hoeh nahanlah, telah nahoeh pawiteh, tami pueng koung kaithi payon han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tami ni Cathut koehoi tounnae ka hmu toe. Kai teh hawihoehnae ka sak mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka hmu hoeh e hah na cangkhai haw, Payonnae hah ka sakpayon pawiteh, bout ka sak mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na lawkkamnae na pahnawt dawkvah, na sak e boiboelah na pathung han na maw. Kai ni na hoeh, nang ni roeroe na kârawi han. Hatdawkvah, na panue e hah deih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Panue thainae katawnnaw hoi, ka lawk ka thai e lungkaangnaw ni kai koe vah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Job ni panuenae tawn laipalah lawk hah a dei, a lawk hah lungangnae kaawm hoeh e naw doeh telah a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Oe Job heh a pout totouh tanouknae lah awm yawkaw naseh, bangkongtetpawiteh, lawk pathungnae hah tamikathoutnaw lawk pathungnae patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a yonnae dawk taranthawnae a thap sin, maimouh koevah, kut tambei teh, Cathut taranlahoi lawk a pap telah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Elihu ni a pathung e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Heteheh, a lan telah na pouk maw, Cathut lannae hlak ka lan telah na dei maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka yonnae hah pap boipawiteh, hot teh, nang hanelah bangmaw a hawinae, meknae hoe ka hmu telah na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nama koe kaawm e naw hoi na pathung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kalvan lah moung nateh khenhaw! khenhaw! nang hlak hoe ka rasang e tâmainaw hah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Yonnae na sak pawiteh, ama taranlahoi bangmaw hoe na kuepcing sak, nahoeh pawiteh kâtapoenae hah pap pawiteh, ama hanelah bangmaw na sak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikalan lah na awm pawiteh, ama hah bangmaw na poe, Nahoeh pawiteh, ama ni na kut dawk hoi bangmaw a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na hawihoehnae ni nang patetlah kaawm e tami hah a ratet, na lannae ni tami capa buet touh a ratet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnephnap e a pap kecu dawkvah a hramki awh, athakaawme taminaw e rektapnae kecu dawkvah, kabawpnae a panki hoi a hram awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hateiteh, apinihai nâmaw kasakkung Cathut, karum lah la sak han ka poe e hah ao telah dei awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Talai e sarang hlak hai apinimaw na cangkhai awh. Kalvan e tava hlak lung na ang sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw a kâoup kecu dawk, hawvah a hram awh ei, pathung awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Banghai bang hoeh e lawk hah Cathut ni khoeroe thai mahoeh, Athakasaipounge, ni hai banglahai noutna mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama teh na hmawt hoeh telah na dei nakunghai, amae hmalah lannae ao teh, ama teh na ring raw na ring han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, atuvah a lungkhueknae dawk hoi na rek hoeh niteh, pathunae hnonaw pueng hah pâkuem hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Job ni a khuekhaw awm laipalah, a pahni a ang teh, panuenae laipalah lawk a pap sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu ni hettelah bout a dei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na ngaithoum awh ei, na hmusak awh han rah. Cathut yueng lah lawk dei hane ka tawn rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka panuenae hah ahlanae koe e ka la han rah, lannae hah kasakkung koe kamnue sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka lawknaw heh ayawmyin lah khoeroe ao hoeh dawkvah, panuenae kuep katawnkung teh nang koe ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khenhaw! Cathut teh a thasai eiteh, apihai dudam hoeh. Ama teh athao teh thonae thaipanueknae hoi a kawi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw hah pâhlung hoeh. Hateiteh, hnephnap e naw hah lannae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikalan teh khen laipalah awm hoeh, hateiteh, siangpahrang hah bawitungkhung dawk yungyoe hanelah a tahung sak teh, ahnimouh teh tawmrasang e lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puenghoi kacaklah katek e lah o awh teh, rucat khangnae rui hoi katek e lah awm boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kâtapoenae hoi a sak e hah lungpata lahoi sakyoenae hoi a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cangkhainae koelah hna a ang sak teh, yonnae dawk hoi bout a ban nahane kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lawkngai laihoi amae thaw tawk awh pawiteh, hnopai tawnta e dawk nawm awh vaiteh, hnin, thapa, kum naw hah lunghawinae hoi a loum sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hateiteh, lawkngai awh hoeh pawiteh, tahloi hoi kahmat ka ta awh vaiteh, panuenae tawn laipalah due awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hateiteh, tamikathout e lungthin ni lungkhueknae a pâtung teh, ama ni a katek torei teh, kabawpnae hei hanelah hram awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nawca nah a due awh teh, a hringnae hah tami kahawihoehnaw hoi rei a pout.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama ni tami ka roedeng hah reithainae thung hoi a hlout sak. Hnephnapnaw hno lahoi a hnâ a ang sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Takithopoung e kângairunae thung hoi ama ni a hlout sak han. Khori kaawm hoeh e, hmuen kakawpoung koe, tawntanae dawk a kâenkhai han, na caboi teh tawntanae hoi kawi vaiteh a poum sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hateiteh, tamikathoutnaw ni hmu han kamcu e lawkcengnae hoi, na kâvan teh, lawkcengnae hoi lannae ni na kuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lungkhueknae ao dawkvah, kâhruetcuet. Nahoeh pawiteh, vai touh hemnae dawk ama ni na cetkhai payon vaih. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ratangnae kalen poung ni na hlout nahane na kabawm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tawntanae hoi na thaonae, na bahu onae pueng ni, na kângairunae dawk hoi na hlout sak han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Karum hah kâuepkhai hanh. Taminaw karum dawk kahmanae tueng lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yonnae dawkvah kamlang hoeh nahanlah kâhruetcuet, bangkongtetpawiteh, reithai khangnae hlak hai na kârawi e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khenhaw! Cathut teh hnotithainae dawk hoi tawmrasang e lah ao. Apinimaw ama patetlah a cangkhai boi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Apinimaw a lamthung hah a poukkhai boi. Apinimaw na sak e hah na payon telah atipouh boi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tawk e thaw hah len sak hanelah pahnim hanh, tami ni la lah a sak awh e hah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami pueng ni a hmu awh teh, tami ni ahlanae koehoi a radoung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khenhaw! Cathut teh a lentoe poung, maimouh ni panuek thai awh hoeh. Kumnaw hai panue thai lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tui ka ca e naw hah, a lathueng lah a sawn teh, tuikahu kaawm e patetlah kho a rak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hote tâmai dawk hoi a rak sak teh, tami e lathueng vah, kho a nan sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tâmai ka tabawk e hoi ama ni a lathueng vah a ramuk e khoparitnaw hah, apinimaw a panue thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khenhaw! a lathueng vah a angnae pheng a tue sak teh, kadung poung e tuipuinaw hah pheng a ramuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, hete hnonaw lahoi, tami hah lawk a ceng teh, rawca koung kakhoutlah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na kut hah sumpapalik hoi a ramuk teh, ka hanelah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khoparit e ni a kamnue sak teh, saringnaw ni hai tûilî a thonae hah a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hete hnonaw ni hai ka lungthin a pâyaw sak teh, lung paluekpaluek ati sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khoparit pawlawk hah kahawicalah thai haw, a pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e ka cairing e naw hah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kalvan rahim pueng a tha teh, a angnae teh talai apout touh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hahoi lawk a tâco teh, a lentoenae lawk hah a kampaw sak. A lawk a thai awh nakunghai kâhat sak hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cathut ni kângairunae hoi a lawk a kampaw sak, a lentoenae hno panue thai awh hoeh e hah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tadamtui koe vah, talai dawk bawt haw telah ati. Hot patetlah, athaonae hoi khorak kayoun hoi khorak kapap koehai a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami pueng ni a sak e a panue awh thai nahanelah, tami pueng e kut hah mitnout a ta pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moithangnaw ni lungngoum thung a kâen awh teh, a onae hmuen dawk lengkaleng ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aka lahoi bongparui a tâco teh, Atunglah hoi kahlî pâding a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cathut e a kâha ni tui a kamkak sak teh, kakawpoung lah kâkadai e tui hah a kamkak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tâmai dawk hoi kho a rak sak teh, a raeng hoi tâmai a kâhin sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Talaivan pueng dawkvah kâ a poe e naw pueng hah a sak awh nahanelah, amae hrawinae dawk hoi a kamlang awh teh, meng a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hring tounnae dawk thoseh, a ram hane dawk thoseh, a lungmanae dawk thoseh, ao sak e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Oe Job, hetheh thai haw, duem awm nateh, kangdout haw. Kângairu Cathut ni a sak e hah pouk haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cathut ni ka ang e tâmai hah ang hanelah, nâtuek vaimoe a patoun tie hah na panue maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tâmai a tawmnae hoi panuenae kakueplah ka tawn e ni, a sak e kângairunae hah na panue maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangdawkmaw na hnicunaw a phubet teh, nâtuek maw akalae kahlî ni talai a pâding sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hlun e rahum hlalang patetlah a tha ka sai e kalvan hah ama hoi reirei na phai roi boimaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama koe dei awh hanelah na cangkhai awh haw, bangkongtetpawiteh, hmonae kecu dawk, banghai kârakueng thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dei han ka ngai telah, ama koe dei hane na maw. Tami buetbuet touh dei sak boipawiteh, a payon roeroe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kahlî a tho teh kalvan hah pin a kâhin sak torei teh, tami ni a angnae hah khen thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Atung lahoi sui raimonae patetlah a tâco teh, Cathut hoi takitho taluenae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Athakasaipounge, teh hmawt thai hoeh. Ama teh ahlawilah hnotithainae a tawn teh, a lannae hoi lawkcengnae dawk hnephnapnae awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ama teh tami ni a taki awh. A lungkaang e taminaw koe hai, kapeknae tawn hoeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hottelah BAWIPA ni Job hah bongparui thung hoi a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Panuenae laipalah e lawk hoi, khokhangnae kahmawtsakkung teh apimaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atuvah tongpatang lah namahoima kârakueng haw, lawk na pacei vaiteh na pathung haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Talai ka kamtawng nah nâmaw na o, na thai panuek pawiteh na dei pouh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Apinimaw bangnuenae a panue thai, na panue thai na maw. Apinimaw bangnuenae a rui hah a lathueng lah a payang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Apinimaw adu hah a ung teh bang ni maw adu hah a casak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tempalo âsinaw hah cungtalah la a sak awh navah, Cathut e capanaw teh lunghawi hoi hram awh hoeh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Talînaw teh thun thung hoi a tâco navah, apinimaw tho a khan sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hnicu hanelah tâmai ka sak pouh teh, a kâkhu hanelah hni lah katha poung e hmonae,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a langri ka khuen pouh teh, tho tarennae ka hruek pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi totouh na tho vaiteh, a hloilah na tapuet mahoeh. Hivah na kâoupnae hoi tuicapa hah pout naseh telah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Talai a pout totouh a kuet teh, tamikathoutnaw peng a tâco thai nahanelah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tâco tahma hoi amom heh kâ na poe teh, a tâconae hmuen na panue sak boimaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mitnoutnae rahim vah talai patetlah meilam a sin teh, hnicu patetlah a kangdue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw koehoi angnae hah a la pouh teh, a dâw e kut hah a khoe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipui a tâconae dawk a kâen boimaw. Adungnae bangnue hanelah koung na rip toung maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Duenae takhang hah nang koe a kamnue sak toung maw. Nahoeh pawiteh, duenae tâhlip takhang hai na hmu boimaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Talai akawnae naw heh be na panue maw. Hetnaw pueng he na panuek pawiteh, na dei pouh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nâ lah maw angnae, khosaknae lamthung ao. Hmonae a hmuen hai nâ lah maw ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hot teh khori dawk na hrawi thai teh, a lamthung hah na panue thai nahanelah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatnae tueng dawk na tâco teh, nange hnin hah apap poung dawkvah, hot teh na panue ngoun vaiyaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tadamtui pâtungnae hmuen koe na kâen toung maw. Roun kamtungnae hmuen te na hmu thoung maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rucatnae atueng hanelah ka ta e hoi tarankâtuk nahane hnin hanelah ka ta e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nâ lae lamthung hoi maw angnae ni pheng a tue teh, talai van vah kanîtholah kahlînaw a kâkahei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tui ka poum e a lawngnae ravo hoi, keitat lamthung hah apinimaw a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Apihai a ohoehnae ram hoi apihai a ohoehnae kahrawngum dawk khorak sak hane hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />King ka di e talai ni kanaw e phovai a dawnnaw tâco sak hanelah, ka poum e khotui a lawngnae lamthung, khoparit hoi sumpapalik lamthung apinimaw a kamawng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khotui ni a na pa a tawn maw. Tadamtui ka bawt e hah apinimaw a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Apie von dawk hoi maw tui kamkak a tâco. Kalvan hoi ka bawt e tadamtui hah apini a khe e na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tui hah talung patetlah a te sak teh, tui adungnae hai be kamkak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Baritca hah na pâkhueng thai teh, kangduetaphai rui hah na rathap thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mazzaroth hah amae tueng nah na tâco sak thai maw. Latum teh a canaw hoi na ceikhai thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kalvan e caksak e naw hah na panue teh, talai heh na uk sak thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kho pueng hoi ka sak e ni na ramuk thai nahanelah, tâmai totouh na lawk na cai sak thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sumpapalik e hah nang koe a tho teh, hivah ka o telah nang koe dei hanelah na patoun thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Apinimaw pouknae dawk lungangnae a poe. Apinimaw lungthin hah panuethainae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Apinimaw lungangnae hoi tâmai a touk thai han. Apinimaw kalvan e tuium rabawk thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Vaiphu hah a te sak teh, tangdong dawk buet touh lah a kâbet toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />a kâkhu dawk hoi a pawp teh, kei hanlah a pawp lahun nah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sendek hane rawca tawng pouh hane sendektancanaw kaboumlah paca thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Vongacanaw vonhlam hoi a kâva teh, Cathut koe a hram awh toteh, apinimaw rawca a poe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mon dawk e Atha ca khenae tueng hah na panue maw, Sayuk ca khenae tueng te na pâkuem thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thapa nâyittouh maw a vawn tie hah na panue thai maw, a khenae tueng te na panue thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tabo awh teh a ca a khe, a canaw teh a pâ sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A canaw hah a dam awh teh kahrawngum a roung awh. A tha ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kahrawng e lanaw hah apinimaw a ngai patetlah a pâ sak. Kahrawng e la pennae rui apinimaw a rasu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kahrawng hah apie im lah maw ka sak teh, kahrawngum hah api khosak nahanelah maw ka sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Runae ka kâhmo e khopui a dudam teh, kahrekkungnaw e hramnae lawk hah noutna pouh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mon teh a pawngpanae lah ao teh, hram kanaw hah a tawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Savitan ni nange thaw a tawk ngai han na maw, na saring im dawk a roe ngai han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Savitan hah a lahuen dawk laikawk kanawknae laphu hah na thueng thai han na maw. Na hnuk lae tangkom a paten ngai han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thao poung dawkvah na kâuepkhai maw. Na thaw hah ahni dawk na patue thai han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na cakang hah im lah a phu hane hoi, cangkatinnae koe cabong pâkhueng sak hanelah, na kâuepkhai thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kalauk vâ ni a rathei hah a kâoup nalaihoi ouk a kamphuet, hatei a rathei hai a muennaw ni lungmanae a tawn maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, talai dawk a tadui a ceitakhai teh, vaiphu dawk a phu a bet sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami ni rakkâbawng lah a coungroe thai, moithangnaw ni a kâbawng sak thai tie hah panuek hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A canaw hah a ca hoeh e patetlah puenghoi a rek teh, a thaw tawk e a hrawnghrang lah ao e hah bang lahai pouk hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut ni lungangnae a lawp teh, thoumthainae hoi pathoup hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A rasangnae koe amahoima a kâtawm toteh, marang hoi marang dawk kâcui e hah a dudam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Marang thaonae hah na poe e na maw, a lahuen dawk khoparit hoi na pathoup boimaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samtong patetlah na pakhi thai maw, ahnie hnawng dawk hoi kacaie lawk teh taki a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tanghling hah a khok hoi a kaphai teh, a thaonae dawkvah a nawm, tarankâtuknae puengcang thung vah karang poung lah a yawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Takithopoung e hah a panuikhai teh, lungpuennae awm boihoeh. Hoehpawiteh, tahloi taki hoi ban boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A lathueng vah palabom hah poe a kâroe teh, pala hoi tahroe hah poe a kâhlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Takitho e hoi lungkhuek nah laihoi, mongka lawk ni hai kacakcalah kangdout sak thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mongka lawk a cai torei teh, awhaw! telah a ti. Taran kâtuknae hah ahlanae koehoi a hmui lah a thai. Kahrawikungnaw a hramnae lawk hoi târuetâho lawk a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cangkhainae lahoi mataw ni a rathei a kadai teh, akalah a kamleng thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Karasangpoung lah a kamleng teh, karasangpoung lah tabu a tuk e hah, nang ni kâ na poe e namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lungha dawk kho a sak teh, karasang e lungha kânguenae rapanim koe ouk a roe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Haw hoi a ca hane hah a tuet teh, a mit ni ahla poungnae koe e hai a hmu thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A canaw ni thi ouk a du awh teh, kadout e moikong onae pueng koe ao awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi BAWIPA ni lawk a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Athakasaipounge, hoi lawk ka oun e ni ama teh a yue han na maw, Cathut ma ni pathung yawkaw seh khe, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Job ni BAWIPA hah a pathung teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khenhaw! kai teh banghai cungkeihoehe lah ka o, bangtelamaw ka pathung han, ka pahni teh ka tabuem toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vai touh ka dei toung dawkvah, ka pathung mahoeh toe. Vai hni touh e teh bout ka dei mahoeh toe telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut ni Job hah bongparui thung hoi a pathung teh hettelah a dei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atuvah tongpatang lah coungkacoe awmh. Lawk na pacei vaiteh na pathung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lawkcengnae hah na pathung katang han maw, na yon hoeh nahanlah yon na pen han maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cathut patetlah kut na tawn maw, ama patetlah pawlawk na cai sak thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Taluenae hoi raimonae lah kamthoup haw, bawilennae hoi na meihawinae kamthoup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lungkhueknae e hah tâcawt sak haw, Kâoup e pueng hah khen nateh pabawt haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kâoup e pueng hah khen nateh rahnoum sak haw, tamikathoutnaw hah a onae hmuen dawkvah repcoungroe sin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaiphu dawk cungtalah be hrawk awh, kâhrawk e hmonae hoi a minhmai hah ramuk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hottelah aranglae na kut ni na rungngang thai e hah, kai ni hai ka pâpho han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khenhaw! nama patetlah ka sak e Behemoth heh maitotan patetlah pho kahring a ca van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A keng dawk e thaonae hoi a vonpui dawk e tharui hnotithainae hah khenhaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A mai teh sidar thing patetlah a kâroe sak teh, a phai dawk e tharuinaw teh a bawk bawk lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hrunaw teh rahum khom patetlah ao teh, a nâhru teh sum khom patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cathut e lamthung dawk hoi ahni te pasuek e lah a o, ahni dueng doeh kasakkung ni tahloi hoi kâhnai sak e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Monnaw ni ca hane a tâco sak, hawvah moithangnaw pueng ni a pai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lotus thingkung rahim vah a tabo teh, lungpum rahim hoi tuinawk dawk hai ouk ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lotus thingkung tâhlip ni a ngue awh, palang rai e sumpakungnaw ni a kalup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />palang tui teh a len thai, hateiteh banglah noutna hoeh, apâhni totouh Jordan tui kalen nakunghai a lungmawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A mit hoi a khet lahun nah, naphai do thai han namaw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leviathan hah hradang hoi alawilah pawk na sawn thai han namaw, rui hoi a lai hah a kam dawk na kawm thai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnawng dawk hnâpacap na pacap sak teh, Tamboung dawk laikaw na buen sak han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang koe ka hei vaiteh, lawk kanemca hoi lawk a dei han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang hoi lawkkamnae sak vaiteh, yungyoe okhai hanelah na la thai han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tavaca patetlah ahni hoi reirei na pai han na maw. Nama e yu lah la hanelah, na pâkhi thai han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na huikonaw ni ama hoi buvennae hah a sak vaiteh, hno kayawtnaw koe, ama teh a rei awh han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tahroe donghmo hah a vuen dawk a kawi sak vaiteh, tanga kamannaw hah tahroe hoi a lû dawk a kawi sak thai nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lathueng vah a kut toung nateh, tarantuknae hah pahnim hoeh, khoeroe bout sak hanh lawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama tâ hane ngaihawinae hah a hrawnghrang doeh, a mithmu vah a tâ thai hoeh e ao han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama lungtho sak hanelah apihai a lungtang mahoeh. Hottelah pawiteh, apimaw ka hmalah ka kangdout thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai ni ka patho hanelah apinimaw hmaloe na poe, kalvan rahim e hnocawngca pueng hah kaie seng doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kut khok thoseh, athaonae pueng thoseh, a takthai a thaonae, a meihawinae hah ka hrawk pouh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Alawilae a pho hah apinimaw a rading pouh thai han, a tamboung hru bawk hni touh kâpâbawk e hah apinimaw rek a hnai thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Apinimaw a minhmai takhang hah a paawng thai han, takikathopounge a hânaw hah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A keng dawk e a pho, a lakepnaw hah a kâoupnae naw lah a o, mitnoutnae patetlah kacakcalah khan e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Buet touh hoi buet touh khikkâcat teh, a rahak dawk kahlî hai kâen thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hotnaw teh buet touh hoi buet touh koung kâkuet teh, kapek thai lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hâ tangawn ni angnae a tâco sak teh, a mit hah kho nueng kadai e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kâko hoi hmaito angnae a tâco teh, hmaitali a tangpei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hnawng dawk hoi hmaikhunaw a tâco teh, moi thawngnae hlaam dawk ka tangdawk e hoi, ka kang e buruk patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kâha ni hmaisaeinaw a kak teh, a pahni dawk hoi hmaito a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lahuen dawk thaonae ao teh, a hmalah lungmathoenae hah a len.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A takthai hoi tharuinaw teh khakkâkuet teh, kâtahruet thai hoeh e kacakpounge lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A lungthin teh talung patetlah a te, Cakang phawmnae a rahim lae talung patetlah a te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thaw torei teh, athakaawme taminaw ni a taki awh, a thao e a taki awh dawkvah, ka pathu e patetlah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahni koe tahloi ka phat nakunghai tâ thai mahoeh, pala, tahroe ni hai tâ thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hottelah Job ni BAWIPA hah a pathung teh hettelah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangpuengpa na sak thai tie hah ka panue, na noenae hah ngang thai lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Apimaw kaie panuenae laipalah khokhangnae ka hrawk e hah telah na pacei. kai hanelah kângairu poung e lah, ka panue hoeh e ka pâpha e lah ao hah ma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pahren lahoi thai nateh, lawk na dei sak haw. Lawk na pacei vaiteh na pathung haw telah na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang teh hnâ hoi dueng doeh na thai rah, hatei, atu teh ka mit hoi na hmu toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kama hoi kama ka kâpanuet teh, hraba hoi vaiphu dawk ka tahung teh, pan ka kângai toe telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Job koevah lawk be a dei hnukkhu, BAWIPA ni Teman tami Eliphaz koevah, nang hoi na hui roi koevah ka lungkhueknae a kâan. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka san Job patetlah kaie kong dawk, lawkkatang hah na dei awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, maitotan 7, tutan 7 hrawi nateh, ka san Job koevah cet awh nateh, nangmouh hanelah thuengnae hah poe awh. Hahoi ka san Job ni nangmouh hanelah a ratoum vaiteh, hote kai ni ka coe pouh han. Nahoeh pawiteh, na pathu awh e patetlah na lathueng lawk na ceng awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka san Job patetlah kaie kong dawkvah, lawkkatang na dei awh hoeh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah Teman tami Eliphaz hoi Shuhi tami Bildad hoi Naamath tami Zophar tinaw a cei awh teh, BAWIPA ni kâ a poe e patetlah a sak awh teh, BAWIPA ni Job kâheinae hah a coe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi Job ni a huinaw kathum touh hanelah, a ratoum pouh torei teh, BAWIPA ni Job kangduenae hmuen hah bout ahawi sak teh, BAWIPA ni Job teh yampa e a tawnta e hlakvah, let hni touh bout a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hottelah a hmaunawnghanaw hoi a tawncanunaw pueng teh, yampa kapanueknaw pueng ni a im dawk a tho awh teh, rawca a ca awh. BAWIPA ni a lathueng vah kathoute a phasak e naw pueng dawk a lungpahawi awh teh a lungmawng sak awh. Tami pueng ni ahni koevah, ngun hoi suinaw hah a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hottelah BAWIPA ni ahmaloe e hlak a hnukteng yawhawinae kapap poung lah a poe. Tu 14,000, kalauk 6,000, maitotan a bo lah 1,000, hoi la manu 1,000 a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ca tongpa 7 touh hoi canu 3 touh hai a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Apasuekpoung e min teh Jemimah, apâhni e teh Keziah, apâthum e teh Kerenhappukh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram thung pueng dawk Job e canu patetlah meikahawi e awm hoeh. A na pa ni ahnimouh teh a thangroinaw koe râw a rei van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hoi Job teh kum 140 a hring teh a ca capanaw hoi a na mincanaw se pali totouh a hmu rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hottelah Job a matawng teh hnintha kuep lahoi a due.
  </para>
</usx>
